<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">EN_ULT en_English_ltr Fri Feb 21 2020 16:38:26 GMT-0500 (EST) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Matthew</para>
  <para style="toc1">Matthew ne Raukegai Samliakeyi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matthew</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat.</para>
  <para style="mt">Matthew</para>
  <para style="mt">Matthew Samliakeyi</para>
  <para style="is">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="ip">Matthew laisiukwak aide ndaage de kwa-regui kebam Messiah de minade kelilu kera gwangbam delie rangbam, Jewme nah Gentileme kenana de. Matthew, kereiekena bau hang ge ne laisiukwak aide raugai lie nlumla. Cide Romme ne Jerusalem ga kerecaki AD 70 bekum teimsia kedi dwa raugai ha cetla.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mark nah Luke de Jisu ha raugai liede, Matthew Samliakeyi de kedabe swa tsam kecu yikemtingdung ge la. Samliakeyi aide ga Matthew Jisu au Samkakkelu Kehegwabe ga rangpwa kela Messiah delie kecu pwalia süt gai. Matthew au Samkakkelu Kehegwabe gade rangsui kiesüt nah “tinggim hegwangram” de cunah teugwang. Aide ziemne mina kekiee ge au pa pe Samliakeyi aide Jewme dage raugai lalie cetla.</para>
  <para style="ip">Matthew au Khrista keledeu kedi ge pa anuide Tinggwang zai cilu kera ngha gai nah minadung dade Tinggwang hegwangram ha nah cide daibi kecu ranglia bam. Khrista keledeusamdung samria mengei aidung gade ngau lula:</para>
  <para style="ip">1. Kideutu gade keledeu (5:1-7:27)</para>
  <para style="ip">2. Ledeukelumedung de keledeusam (10:5-42),</para>
  <para style="ip">3. Samgwadung gade keledeu (13:3-52),</para>
  <para style="ip">4. Ledeukelume ketei pekie (18:1-35),</para>
  <para style="ip">5. Kekamle ting ha nah tinggim hegwangram ha keledeu sam (24:4-25:46),</para>
  <para style="iot">Pelung ga keladung</para>
  <para style="io1">Pedwale ha nah nteikecu (5:1-7:27),</para>
  <para style="io1">Galilee ga bata (5:1-18:35)</para>
  <para style="io2">Kideutu reude keledeu (5:1-7:29),</para>
  <para style="io2">Miswakegah bata gade hetaketei (8:1-10:42),</para>
  <para style="io2">Samgwadung gade keledeu (11:1-13:52),</para>
  <para style="io2">Mingaukerau nah cailikedi (13:53-16:12),</para>
  <para style="io2">Jisu au Tinggwang na (16:13-18:35),</para>
  <para style="io1">Peting kekamle (19:1-28:20),</para>
  <para style="io2">Jerusalem lebie kemie (19:1-20:34),</para>
  <para style="io2">Hecili eh kelüt (21:1-17),</para>
  <para style="io2">Khrista au keledeube (21:18-25:46),</para>
  <para style="io2">Tutiak, ketsai nah kekung (26:1-27:66),</para>
  <para style="io2">Ringcuhkelu nah cuhkedi (28:1-20),</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s">Jisu kiria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Abraham napei David, David napei, Jisu Khrista paupak ha laisiukwak. <verse eid="MAT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Abraham au Isaac pei, nah Isaac au Jacob pei, nah Jacob au Judah, nah pe siname pei. <verse eid="MAT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Judah au Perez penai Zerah pei, nah penai pui cai Tamar, nah Perez au Hezron pei, nah Hezron au Ram pei. <verse eid="MAT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Ram au Amminadab pei, nah Amminadab au Nahshon pei, nah Nahshon au Salmon pei.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 4:19">Rut. 4:19</ref>,<ref loc="RUT 4:20">20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Salmon au Boaz pei nah pe pui cai Rahab, nah Boaz au Obed pei, nah pe pui cai Ruth, nah Obed au Jesse pei. <verse eid="MAT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />Jesse au hegwangpei David pei, nah David au Solomon pei, nah pe pui cai Uriah nau.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:24">2 Sam. 12:24</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Solomon au Rehoboam pei, nah Rehoboam au Abijah pei, nah Abijah au Asa pei. <verse eid="MAT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Asa au Jehoshaphat pei, nah Jehoshaphat au Joram pei, nah Joram au Uzziah pei. <verse eid="MAT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Uzziah au Jotham pei, nah Jotham au Ahaz pei, nah Ahaz au Hezekiah pei. <verse eid="MAT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Hezekiah au Manasseh pei, nah Manasseh au Amon pei, nah Amon au Josiah pei. <verse eid="MAT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />Israelme de Babylon gage tuiteu mie kecu tingdau, Josiah pe na Jechoniah<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Jechoniah: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mede Coniah mede Jehoiachin. Judahme hegwang, Nebuchadnezzar ne tuibaang di 596 BC dau, Jeremiah tingdau (Jer. 22:24,28; 37:1)</char></note> nah pe siname lunghlu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 27:20">Jer. 27:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Babylon gage tui teu gwang kelucai, Jechoniah pe na Shealtiel lunghlu, nah Shealtiel pe na Zerubbabel lunghlu. <verse eid="MAT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Zerubbabel au Abiud pei, nah Abiud au Eliakim pei, nah Eliakim au Azor pei. <verse eid="MAT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Azor au Zadok pei, nah Zadok au Achim pei, nah Achim au Eliud pei. <verse eid="MAT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Eliud au Eleazar pei, nah Eleazar au Matthan pei, nah Matthan au Jacob pei. <verse eid="MAT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />Jacob pe na, Mary nahpei Joseph lunghlu, nah pane Khrista lie qukela Jisu de mnalu. <verse eid="MAT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Ceheu pelane Abraham gade David kecang de ceheu kereiemdai ge bam, nah David gade Babylon ga tuiteu gwang kedi nah Khrista ting kecang ceheu kereiemdai ge bam.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Khrista de kemna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Jisu Khrista de ainzwa mnalu. Pe pui, Mary, Joseph de ngngwa lungh kerane naurang teilu, dede penai ngngwa ncüt kemakne gade, mipuibe Kemci Rabe gade tetlak la kedi cidi. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Dede pe nahpei Joseph au kemzuime ge nah mtei dwade pecu peu hengam teineu ma, cine pa pecu ngkim eh tadi kera cetlu. <verse eid="MAT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Pa ma aidungde cet kebamdau, ainie, Rampaube gwame ge pe mangle de peda gwang eh ranggai, “David napei, Joseph, Mary de n nau kera ngngidi helo, kedanemene pa tetlak kela de au Kemci Rabe gade lu. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />Pa mipei nage de mna luzie, nah nang pe zi Jisu lie msiak zie, kedanemene pa pe mina de penui maudung gade kelibeu zie.” <verse eid="MAT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Ma aidung pelane Rampaube ne caihakecibe dage kerang de teicanglu kerane teigai, ainzwa ranggai,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 7:14">Isa. 7:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />“Ainie, relei kemci pui ge tetlak luzie nah mipeina ge de mna luzie, nah penui pe zi Immanuel quzie” cide pekie, “Tinggwang anuide ngngwabam.”<verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Pecai Joseph ziep kebam gade mraklu nah Rampaube gwame pe dage kerang nzwa teilu nah pa Mary de pe naulu. <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />Dede henanabe de mnalu kemaktane Joseph pe nau de ngngwa nauhepei zai tei ma. Nah pa pezi Jisu msiaklu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s">Makecime gwang piekecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Herod hegwang ketei tingdau Judea deu Bethlehem<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Bethlehem: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Namceu aide Jerusalem tingpile gade kilometre 8 kenzwa dei ge.</char></note> nam gage Jisu de mna kelucai, ainie, makecimedung naimiak kepetle deu lamde Jerusalem ga gwang, <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />keteu, “Daiga Jewme Gwang mna kenzeube de bamno? Anui naimiak kepetle cuikui de pe gi ngau eh pecu reca kerane gwangla.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 24:17">Pum. 24:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Dede hegwangpei Herod sam aide siu luge, pa pelung keherei sütdi, nah pecu ngngwa Jerusalem ga kebam pelane cinzwadi. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Pecai Herod cingku kedimedung nah laisiukecime pelane de qu hekwalu, delwe pa penui dage keteu, “Khrista de dai gage mna zielie lano?” <verse eid="MAT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Penui pe dage rangdi, “Judea deu Bethlehem gage, kedanemene caihakecibe ainzwa rau nzeulu,<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />‘Dede nang Bethlehem, Judahme deu gade,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">Judah ga kedimedung kakgade ceutunabe meda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">kedanemene nda de hegwang ge gwang zie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">a mina Israel mapie kerabe.’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 5:2">Mic. 5:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Pecai Herod ngkim eh makecimedung de qulu, daidau ting siakdau hegi petti bi kecu penui dade keteu kerane. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Pecai pa penui de Bethlehem gage langgai eh ranggai, “Mie delwe henanabe de peei sünne lu. Nnui pecu ngaulu de, acu ranglia lo, ciude Ih de gwang eh pecu recalu kerane.” <verse eid="MAT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Penui hegwangpei rang kegaide siu kelucai, penui lampui gage tet gaidi, nah ainie, naimiak kepetlebie penui hegi kengau de penui dwarai jüja mie, henanabe kebam peureu ga gwang mtakdi kemaktane. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Penui hegi de ngau luge, penui suiyisüt eh bamdi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 2:20">Luk. 2:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Pecai penui kilung ga lütlu delwe henanabe de pepui Mary ne ngngwa kebam ngaulu. Penui keumie eh pecu reca. Penui mabamdung de hiaklu eh kecak, perimkehengui nah maca mapeudung pwa pecu peugai. <verse eid="MAT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Dede hemang gade Tinggwang penuide Herod da cailigwang dai helo beu, cine penui lampui kedale de penui deudi rip gage tetgaidi.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Egypt gage pakgaikedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Penui tet kedicai, ainie, Joseph mangle de Rampaube gwame ge peda gwang eh ranggai, “Cuhlu, henanabe de nah pepui de ngngwa eh Egypt gage pakgailu. Ih n dage sam kaibeu kemaktane cika bamdi lu, kedanemene henanabe de teingkapdi kerane Herod pecu peei gwang zielu.” <verse eid="MAT 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Cine cipau ziu, Joseph cuhlu, nah henanabe penai pepuide ngngwa pwa Egypt gage tet gaidi. <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />Herod tsaidi kemaktane penui cika bamdi. Aide Rampaube caihakecime dage, “Ih Egypt gade anade qu mpetlu,” de eh rang kegai de teicanglu kerane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 11:1">Hos. 11:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Pecai Herod, makecimedung pecu nuineu kebam pa ngaulu ge, pe rata sütti. Cine pa langgai eh Bethlehem nah cipau cuikui pelane ga kebam mipeina hename leune, mmi kena nah pe ngkangme de teitsetdi, pa makecime dade peting ci siakte kelu rehi gade. <verse eid="MAT 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Iciu eh caihakecibe Jeremiah rang kenzeu de teicanglu, pa ranggai,<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />“Ramah gade makwa ge siudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">kehap nah misuisiasüt kecu ge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">Rachel pe namedung ziemne kehap,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">nah pa pelung taumla neu tadi, kedanemene penui gah kedine.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:15">Jer. 31:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nazareth ga cailikegwang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Herod tsai kedicai, ainie, Rampaube gwame ge Egypt gade Joseph da pemang lede gwang eh, <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />ranggai, “Cuhlu nah henanabe penai pepuide ngngwalu delwe Israel deu gage tet gailu, kedanemene henanabe keringria ngkapdi kera peei kelame tsaidi delu.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 4:19">Tet. 4:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Pecai Joseph cuhlu, delwe henanabe penai pepuide ngngwalu, delwe Israelme deu ga gwangdi. <verse eid="MAT 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Dede Archelaus pe pei Herod bam leu eh Judea deu ga kengkieng teu kebam ha Joseph siu luge, cika tetgai kera pa ngngidi. Pemang lede Tinggwang pe dage marang kegaicai, pa Galilee cuikui lege tet gaidi, <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />nah mie delwe Nazareth lie qukela namdi ga lunghdi. Ainzwa eh, caihakecime pecu Nazarene lie de qu zie de rangpwa kelade teicanglu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 18:7">Luk. 18:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s">Duipumketeibe John lampui kelamlui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Cidau tingdau duipumketeibe John Judea hetaideu gade mide ledeu gwang eh ranggai, <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />“Helungnreu lulo, kedanemene tinggim hegwangram nnadi delu.” <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Kedanemene mina aipaude caihakecibe Isaiah ne rang kegaibe deda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">“Mige hetaideu gade sahbakla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">‘Rampaube lampui mtei lulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">pe lampuidung tei mzuilu.’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Isa. 40:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />John aipau de ut mai le pe paini tei nah teigeu kiakang pekia ga kang teula. Pe taktyei au tangrim nah heliadui.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 1:8">2 Heg. 1:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Pecai Jerusalem, nah Judea pelane, nah Jordan Reu twakengwa cuikui pelane gade mina peda gwang. <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />Penui maudung petlu eh pa penuide Jordan Reu gade duipum teibeu. <verse eid="MAT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Dede Phariseeme nah Sadduceeme mina kekiee ge duipum tei kera peda gwang kela pa ngau luge, pa penui dage rangdi, “Nnui neiduipui leuhmedung, caune nnuide Tinggwang lunghop gwang kela gade pak lulo rangbeu no? <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Helungkenreu tsi bui lulo. <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />Nah nnui kakgade, ‘Abraham au anui pei lie,’ de eh rang kera cet so. Kedanemene Ih nnui dage rang gaila, Tinggwang au Abraham ziemne hename aipau tangtsudung gade teucuh lubui. <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />Dede mreube tsingbang mah gage kaizeu dida. Cine tsingbang petsi keyi builu kemak keheibe de bi kaudi eh mi gage keliengai dizie. <verse eid="MAT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />Ih nnuide helungnreulu kerane dui le duipum teibeu. Dede acai gwangkelabe au aswa diki, nah Ih au pe picumdung pwalu kerade duilie. Pa nnuide Kemci Rabe nah mi le duipum teibeu zie. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Pe ciudap peba gala, pe hecaipung gui mcigilu kerane, nah ciudung pebau gage hekwalu kerane. Dede pa perie pwa madaude mmüt kelak mi gage ru dizie.”<verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu duipum teikelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Pecai Jisu Galilee gade Jordan Reuki ga John da gwanglu, pe dade duipum tei kerane. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Dede John pecu kam kera tei eh, ranggai, “Nangne acu duipum tei kerabe, dede nang ada gwang lani?” <verse eid="MAT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Dede Jisu keligai nah pe dage rangdi, “Cu tei kera peulo, kedanemene kemzuibe leune teicang kera anai ziemne petaulu.” Cine John suizwalu. <verse eid="MAT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Pecu duipum tei luge, Jisu dui gade zette cuhlu, nah ainie, tinggimdung pecu ngkei pwapeu, nah pa Tinggwang Rabe tamhau nzwa hung eh pereu ga mtak kedi ngau. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Ge, ainie, makwa ge tinggim gade, “Aide ana akube. Ih pecu a suisüt bam,” de eh rangdi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Lei. 2:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s">Jisu de kedeikecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Pecai Jisu de herakesiabe de peu kedei kerane Kemci Rabe ne hetaideu gage ngngwa gaidi. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Pa tingba zie riakdai nah tingmuizie riakdai mmwang kelucai, pa mzeudi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:28">Tet. 34:28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Ge kedei kecube gwang eh pe dage rangdi, “Magade Nang Tinggwang Na liecai, tangtsu aidungde de tangku mmi lulo beulo.” <verse eid="MAT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Dede Jisu pecu keligai eh rangdi, “Kesanglaisiu ga ainzwa rauteula, ‘Mina tangku rünne tyei eh lungh gailak, dede Tinggwang mui gade kepet sam leune gade zie.’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Hez. 8:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Pecai herakesiabe pecu kemci namdi ga ngngwa gwanglu delwe pecu peu kerecaki hutube ga bamlu,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 4:9">Luk. 4:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />nah pe dage rangdi, “Magade nang Tinggwang Na liecai, nkatei ncu kelien gailo, kedanemene ainzwa raupwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">‘Pa n ma pielu kerane pe gwame de aja kai beuzie,’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11-12">Lei. 91:11-12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">nah, ‘Penui penui ba gage ncu teucuh luzie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">ciu eh nang n pi tangtsu ge reu gage de rejam melu kerane.’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11">Lei. 91:11</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 91:12">12</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Jisu pe dage rangdi, “Iciu de ainzwa rau pwala, ‘Nang Rampaube n Tinggwang de kedei so.’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:16">Hez. 6:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Pecaide, herakesiabe pecu kideutu husüt kecu ga ngngwa nghang nah pecu kideube hegwangram leune, penui kendu leune de si eh keulia. <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />Herakesiabe Jisu dage rangdi, “Ma aidung leune Ih ncu pwa peuzie, nang keumie eh acu recalu cai.” <verse eid="MAT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Ge Jisu pe dage rangdi, “Aika de tet dilu, Satan! Kedanemene ainzwa rau pwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:10">‘Nang Rampaube n Tinggwang de reca zie, nah nang pe gwa rünne teizie.’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">Hez. 6:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Ge herakesiabe pecu pütdi, nah ainie, tinggimgwamedung gwang eh pe gwatei di.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu ledeucuh kedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Cidau John de tui pwa kedi Jisu siu luge, pa Galilee lambie gwangdi. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />Pa Nazareth de pütti eh Capernaum namdi ga mie lunghdi, cide Galilee Jaaidi tai kemna ge ga, Zebulun penai Naphtali deu ga. <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />Isaiah caihakecibe rang kenzeu de teicanglu kerane aide teigai,<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />“Zebulun deu nah Naphtali deu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:15">jaaidi lambie, Jordan kahpet,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:15">Gentileme Galilee!<verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />Kemui ga kebamme minadung</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">kebaa kedi ge ngaulu da,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">nah ketsai cuikui nah ketsai sung ga bam kelame,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">reuga kebaa ge cuh dida.”<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Cipau ting gade Jisu sam ledeu eh, “Nnui lung nreulu, kedanemene Tinggim hegwangram nna bam dida,” de eh rang gwang.<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Caisui keraime de qukelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Jisu Galilee Jaaidi kung ga tet gwang keladau, pa siname hangna, Peter lie qu kelabe Simon, nah pecaihereibe Andrew, jaaidi gade helang sam bam eh ngau, kedanemene penai heka ketuime kecune. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Jisu penai dage rangdi, “Gwanglu, acai suilu, nah Ih nnaide mina de ketuime teibeu zie.” <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Ge penai langdung püt zette di delwe pecai suidi. <verse eid="MAT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Jisu tetgwang kezeudau cikade, pa siname keda hangna, Zebedee napei James, nah pecaihereibe John de ngaulu. Penai pei Zebedee de ngngwa eh liem ga penui helangdung retak bam. Pa penaide qugai, <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />ge penai liem nah penai peide püt zette di delwe pecai suidi.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu keteeikeneeime de teikengkei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Pecai Jisu Galilee deu pelane ga rwa gwang eh penui synagoguedung ga mide ledeu, nah hegwangram samliakeyi de ledeu, nah mateei kehei leune nah minadung kakga keteeikeneei leune de teingkeibeu. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Pe ha Syria deuceu pelane ga ci gwangdi, nah minadung peda mateei ketsamtsam kebam leune de nah teei eh keherei kebam, nah herakesia ne ngngwateu kelame, nah kehekimme nah kemnoime de ngngwa gwang; nah Jisu penuide teingkeibeu. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Maadidung Galilee gade, nah Decapolis<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Decapolis: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">deuzi ge, namdi kerei bamla, Galilee Jaaidi naimiak kenlüt lebie.</char></note>, nah Jerusalem, nah Judea, nah Jordan reuki gwale gade pecai sui ladi.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s">Samlam pungtumedung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Jisu hemaabe de ngaugai eh pa lamlwa reuga nghangdi. Pa ntum bam kelucai, pe caisuimedung peda gwang. <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />Jisu penuide ledeu cuhdi,<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />“Rabe kilam nneila reulie ci kelame samlam pungtu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:3">kedanemene tinggim hegwangram penui gu zielu.<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />Hei eh hap kelame samlam pungtu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:4">kedanemene penui kerelui ngaulu zielu.<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />Nciep kebamme samlam pungtu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:5">kedanemene penui kideube gumlu zielu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 37:11">Lei. 37:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />Makesangbe ziemne nzeu nah hereu kelame samlam pungtu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:6">kedanemene penui nggeilu zielu.<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />Mide ngaunggia kelame samlam pungtu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:7">kedanemene penui ngaugia ngaulu zielu.<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />Pelung kemcime samlam pungtu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:8">kedanemene penui Tinggwang de ngau zielu.<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />Kezuyi ta tei kelame samlam pungtu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:9">kedanemene penuide Tinggwang namedung lie qu zielu.<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />Makesangbe ziemne keherei kelame samlam pungtu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:10">kedanemene tinggim hegwangram penui gu zielu.<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />Minadung nnuide kii nah teikeherei, nah kenret eh ma kesia leune rang eh aziemne nnuide mmaucai nnui samlam pungtu. <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Nnui suiyilu nah suiyi süt lulo, kedanemene nnui tinggim gade ziehi kedi ngau zielu. Kedanemene ainzwa eh minadung caihakecime nnui dwa kelungme dede teikeherei delu.<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mcai nah kebaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />Nnui au kideu mcaibe delie. Dede magade mcai pe nggum gah dicai, daipaile cide teikum dailu laino? Cide makeheibe ziemne de pe keyi gah da, kelien gidi eh mina pidau teidi kera gwale. <verse eid="MAT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />Nnui kideu kebaabe delie. Namdi ge kideutu reu gage tei kelude kebai gailak. <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Mede mina mi mtaulwe mabung kang gage kaizeu lama, dede mitaubam gage kaila, nah cide kilung ga kebam pelane ziemne gi mbaa beula. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Peu n kebaa de mina dwade gi mbaa lulo, iciu de penui n ta keyidung de ngau eh tinggim ga kebam n Pei de twalu kerane.<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hezaibe teicangkelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />Ih hezai mede caihakecidung de teingkapdi kerane gwang lie kecu cetti so. Ih cidungde teingkapdi kerane gwang ma, dede teicangbeu kerane lie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:4">Rom. 10:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Kedanemene Ih nnui dage rangsiakte gaila, tinggim nah kideu gahdi kemaktane, tau kegai keceunage mede pekie keceunage de hezai gade gahdi lak, ma pelane teicanglu kemaktane. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Cine keheibede ajadung gade ceutunabe de gikah delwe mi kedamedung de cinzwa teilo ledeu kelabe de tinggim hegwangram gade ceutube lie quzie. Dede keheibede cidungde mzai nah cidungde ledeu kelabe, tinggim hegwangram ga kedi lie quzie. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />Ih nnui dage rang gaila, laisiukecime nah Phariseemedung masangdung swade, n masangdung yikilu mecai, nang tinggim hegwangram ga nlüt gailak.<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dapketset</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />Ndaa penui dage rang kegaide nnui siuda, ‘Mide teitset so,’ nah, ‘Mide teitset kelame tutiak ga gwang zie.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13">Tet. 20:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Dede Ih nnui dage ranggai la, keheibede pe sinabepei de perata kelabe tutiak ga gwang zie; nah keheibede pe sinabepei dage, ‘Nang kemta kau ge!’ de eh kerangbe baudibe dwa ga gwang zie; nah keheibede, ‘Nang kemiebo!’ de eh kerangbe mijaai ga gwang dilu kebui kerehim bam. <verse eid="MAT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />Ciziemne nang n mapeu de recabam gage reca lai eh kebamdau, cikade n sinabe ncu madungge mmaukebam nsunglu cai, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />n mapeude recabam dwa gage kaizeu dilu. Mie delwe n sinabe de ngngwa kezuyi railu, nah pecaine gwang delwe n mapeude reca beulu. <verse eid="MAT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />Ncu mmau kelabe de ngngwakeyi tei nzetlu, nang pecu ngngwa tutiak ni ga mie kelane ge, mecai ncu mmau kelabe ncu tutiakbe dage kaidi lubui, nah tutiakbe ne kedibe dage, nah ncu hebaangki gage kaidi lubui. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Ih n dage rangsiakte gaila, nang mide rangkang peukera kebam pelane de peu cangdi kemaktane nang cikade mpet gailak.<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kelak kahpet kemmha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />‘Mmha so,’ de eh kerang de nnui siu da. <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Dede Ih nnui dage ranggai la, keheibede mipui gede hengin eh pecu piecai pa pelung gade pecu ngngwa mmha dida. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Magade n miak zetle ncu teimsia lacai, cide let mpetdi delwe cide n dade keugi dilu. Kedanemene n pum zige gah kedibe n ziemne yiki, iciu eh n pum pelane mijaai gage kelien gaidi melu kerane. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Magade n ba zetle ncu teimsia lacai, cide dang gidilu delwe cide n dade keliengi dilu. Kedanemene n pum ga zige gah kedibe n ziemne yiki, iciu eh n pum pelane mijaai ga gwangdi melu kerane.<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lakcak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />Ainzwa rang sigai, ‘Keheibede pe naude ta cai, peu pecu nauta laisiu pwa pecu peulu.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:1-14">Hez. 24:1-14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Dede Ih nnui dage ranggaila, keheibede pe naude ta kedibe, kemmha ta teikedi ziemne meliecai, pecu kemmhame ge tei dida. Keheibede pecu ta kedi caine pecu ngngwa lunghme kecube de kemmha ta tei dida.<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kereset</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />Pecaide, ndaa keraime dage rang kegai de nnui siuda, ‘Kenretpe sampet tei so, dede n sampetdung de Rampaube dage tei gailu.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:21">Hez. 23:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Dede Ih nnui dage ranggai la, madaude reset so, Tinggim dede teu eh, kedanemene cide au Tinggwang hegwangbam kecune;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:1">Isa. 66:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />mede kideu de teu eh teiso, kedanemene cide pe pidau lu; mede Jerusalem de teu eh tei so, kedanemene cide Hegwangpei kedibe namdi kecune.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:1">Isa. 66:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Mede n peu lede reset so, kedanemene nang tam leige de tei ha mede teitiak gai laklu. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Dede n samrangbe peu ‘Yeo,’ mede ‘Ma,’ delu. Iciu de makeheibe de aiswa si dicai cide kesiabe dade gwang dida.<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Miakket kum miakket</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />Nnui rangkegai aide siu luda, ‘Miakket kum miakket, nah geige kum geige.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:21">Hez. 19:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Dede Ih nnui dage ranggai la, kesiame nsam teiso. Meliene, midungge n bia zetle kepeu cai, keda lede nreu beulo. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Magade mikangge ncu ngngwa tutiak kiga mie neucai nah n ncwa keuteu dicai, peu cipaude de n cwatie de peu luulu. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Keheibe de kemei tei eh ncu peu mile ge tetcai, pecu ngngwa mile kena mielu. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />N dade kie kela keheibe de peulu, nah n dade ma hepok neu kela keheibe dade nreutet diso.<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngauraume de keku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />Nnui siu luda rang kegai aide, ‘Nang n kidabe de hunglu nah n ngauraume de ngkaulu.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev. 19:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Dede Ih nnui dage ranggai la, nnui ngauraume de hunglu nah nnuide tei keherei kelame ziemne kielu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kehegwa keyi kwakdung ga </char><char style="fqa">Ncu reset kelame de samlambeu lu, ncu ngaurau kelame dage heta keyi teigai lu </char> de kecu de bamla ma. </note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:14">Rom. 12:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />ciciu de nnui tinggim ga kebam n Pei name teilu kerane. Kedanemene pa pe tingnaimiak peu kemaume nah keyime reu ga cuhlu la, nah tingrui kemzuime nah mzui kemakme dage langgai la. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Kedanemene nnui nnuide ku kelame de kula liecai, dai ziehi ge nnui ngau lulai? Heraha kehame de cikenzwa teila meni? <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Nnui nnui caihereiswacing de rünne kelumla liecai, daige nnui kedame swa tei ntwa lano? Gentileme de cikenzwa ta teila meni? <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Ciziemne tinggim ga kebam nnui Pei yicangsiak kecu nzwa nnuide yicangsiaklu maisia,.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:2">Lev. 19:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s">Kegahme de makepeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />Nnui heta keyi ketei mina dwade peu penuide ngau eh tei melu kerane sünne lulo, iciu liecai nnui tinggim ga kebambe nnui Pei dade ziehi ngau gailak. <verse eid="MAT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />Cine nnui mide ma kepeu dau, telui kwa ncu tei ndu so, hezai keteime synagoguedung nah puididung ga ketei nzwa, iciu eh penui mina hetwa ngaulu kerane. Ih nnui dage rangsiakte gaila, penui au penui ziehi ngau luda. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Dede nnui mide ma kepeu dau, n ba hilebie de peu n ba zetlebie daitei au bi kecu ciso, <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />iciude n mapeu de kengkim gade lu kerane. Iciude n Pei Tinggwang kengkim ngau kelabe ncu ziehi peu zie.<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kekie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />Nnui kekie keteidau, hezai keteime nzwa diso, kedanemene penui au synagoguedung gade nah puidi kungdung gade sap eh kekie tei neula, iciu eh minadung depeu penuide ngaulu kerane. Ih nnui dage rangsiakte gaila, penui au penui ziehi ngau luda. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Dede nnui, nnui kekie ketei dau, n kibung helungle nlütlu, nah n kikam ngkui dilu, n Pei ngkim eh kebam be dade kie lu. Pecai n Pei ngkim eh pie kebam be ncu ziehi peu zie. <verse eid="MAT 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />Nnui kekie ketei dau, Gentileme nzwa, buikemakpe rang daidai eh kieso, kedanemene penui au penui samrang kekiee de ziemne penuide kingneilu zielie cetla. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />Ciziemne, penui nzwa diso, kedanemene nnui Pei au nnui kie kemak dwade nnui dai teu maisia bi cibam. <verse eid="MAT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />Ciziemne ainzwa eh kielu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">‘Tinggim kebam anui Pei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:9">peu n zi de hetwa kepung kemcibe tei lulo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 11:2">Luk. 11:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />N hegwangram teigwang kelube tei lulo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:10">Tinggim ga nzwa eh kideu gade</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:10">nsui nrang tei kelube tei lulo.<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Tingba ramsangne pok anuide henai peulo.<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />Anui maugi beulo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:12">anui de mimau gibeu kelanzwa eh.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />Anuide pwa kehedei gage kai diso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:13">dede kesiabe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kesiabe </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Satan</char></note> dade anuide kelibeu lo.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kehegwa keyi kwakdung ga </char><char style="fqa">Kedanemene hegwangram, kengkieng nah kendu au kelungta ngu zie. Amen </char>de kecu de bam lama. </note><verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />Nnui mina nnui dage teimaukedi maugi beucai, tinggim ga kebam nnui Pei de nnui teimau kedi maugi beuzie. <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Dede nnui penui teimau kedi mau gibeu mecai, nnui Pei de nnui teimau kedi maugi beulak.<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kemmwang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />Nnui kemmwang dau, hezai keteime nzwa suisiet zu lia eh teiso, kedanemene penui penui zu tei ntsam dila, iciu eh mmwang kebam nzwa mina de lialu kerane. Ih nnui dage rangsiakte gaila, penui au penui ziehi ngau luda. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Dede nnui, nnui kemmwang dau, n peu maca pwa keniaklu nah nzu nrüt mcilu, <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />iciude nnui mmwang kebam kedame ci melu kerane, dede nnui Pei ngkim eh kebambe rünne cilu kerane; nah nnui Pei kengkim ngau kelabe, nnuide ziehi peu zie.<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tinggim ga mabam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />Kideu gage nnui ziemne mabam hekwa so, taklei nah mtu ne teimsiadi kera gage, nah keregame raklüt eh rega kera gage. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Meliene, n ziemne mabam tinggim gage hekwalu, cika taklei mede mtu ne teimsiadi gailak, nah cika keregame raklüt mede rega teudi gailak. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />N mabam kebam ga, cika n mlung de bamla kecune. <verse eid="MAT 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />Mimiak au mipum mibung da. Ciziemne, n miak yi bamcai, n pum pelane baa bamla. <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />Dede n miak siacai, n pum pelane muiting dizie. Ciziemne, nda kebam kebaade kemuibe liecai, cide daikenzwa de mui zieno! <verse eid="MAT 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />Migede hangna kila tei gailak, kedanemene pa mi hangge de ncau nah kedabe de hung zie, mede pa hangge da masang nah kedabe de mlai dizie kecune. Nnui Tinggwang nah mahei gwatei gailak.<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Helung keherei so</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />Ciziemne Ih nnui dage rang gaila, nnui teilung ziemne helung pang so, dai tyei ziebi mede dai sak ziebi, mede n pumteih ziemne, dai bah nni ziebi de eh. Ketyei kesak swa teilungbe diki meni, nah mipumbe paini swa diki meni? <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Tinggim ga kela ruinedung de pie gailo: penui heleuh teugi gai lama mede luhlüt lama, mede hebau gage teugwang hekwa lama, dede tinggim ga kebam nnui Pei penui pok tei beula. Nnui cidungde swa yiki melui ni? <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Dede nnui caube pelung pang eh pe teilung cubit ge <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:27 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Cubit ge</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: mok ge</char></note> de tei mtie lubui no? <verse eid="MAT 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />Daitei nnui paiheni ziemne nnui lung pang lano? Luh ga teizuine dainzwa lungh labi cetgai pielo. Penui matei lama, nah penui pai dak lama. <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />Dede Ih nnui dage ranggai la, Solomon kecang de pe kendu leune gade, pe pwa cikenzwa teuma. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Dede Tinggwang luh ga tseheidung cu lungh gai eh ncünne keru bam gage kaidi kela dede pepwa tei hemisüt beucai, pa nnui pwa ciswade tei hemi ki beulak luini, nnui kenlum kecammedung? <verse eid="MAT 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />Ciziemne nnui, ‘Anui dai tyeilai?’ mede, ‘Anui dai saklai?’ mede, ‘Anui dai paini teulai?’ de eh nnui lung pang so. <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />Kedanemene Gentileme ma aidungde pelane peeila, nah tinggim kebam nnui Pei nnui cidung pelane teumaikesia cibam. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Dede Tinggwang hegwangram nah pe masang peei rai lulo, ciude ma aidungde pelane nnuide peuzie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:31">Luk. 12:31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Ciziemne, ncünne ziemne helung pang so, kedanemene ncünne pekatei ziemne helung pang zie. Tingnai ramsangne pekatei perei kekiee bamkap.<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s">Mimau kepeei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />Mide mmau so, iciude Tinggwang de nnuide mmau melu kerane. <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />Kedanemene nnui mide kemmau kenzwa, nnuide de mmau zie, nah nnui mide mdet pwapeu kela mdetde le, nnuide de mdet beuzie. <verse eid="MAT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />Daitei eh n sinabe miak ga kehera keceuna ge kebam de pie lano, dede nkatei n miak ga tsinglwa kebam de be ngau lama no? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Mede dainzwa n sinabe dage, ‘N miak gade kehera de peu acu keu mpetlu,’ de eh nang ranglu laino, ainie, nkatei n miak ga tsinglwabe bam mene? <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Nang hezai teikelabe! Keraibe nkatei n miak gade tsinglwa kebam de keumpet dilu, nah pecai n sinabe miak ga kehera kebam de ngau mcigi eh keumpet luzie. <verse eid="MAT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />Ma kemcibe heteudung de peu so, nah ngu tangtsu hebak hau dwa gage kelien gaiso. Mecai penui pi le cidungde daudi lubui, delwe nreu gwang eh ncu teu rak kecai dizie.<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kie, peei, ketung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />Kielu, ciciude nnuide pwapeu zie. Peeilo, iciude nnui ngau luzie. Ketunglu, iciude nnuide ngkei beuzie. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Kie kelame leune, ngau lula; nah peei kelabe, ngau lula; nah ketung kelabe de, ngkei beuzie. <verse eid="MAT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />Mede nnui kakga mina cauge, pe napei pe dade tangkukwak ge kiege, pa pecu tangtsu pwapeu lano? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Mede pa heka ge kiege, pa pecu henei pwapeu lano? <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Ciziemne, nnui kemaume de nnui name de mapeu keyi peu kera ciem ci liecai, tinggim ga kebam nnui Pei Tinggwang pe dade kie kelame de ciswa kemzu mapeu keyi peu zie meluini?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 11:13">Luk. 11:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />Ciziemne, ma pelane gade, mide peu nnui dage teigai keneube, nnuide cinzwa midage teigai lulo, kedanemene aide hezai nah caihakecimedung sam delu.<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Herie kenrum nah kemza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />Herieki kenrumbe gade lütlu. Kedanemene kengkap gage ngngwagwang beukela rieki au mza nah lampui de dilu, nah mina kekiee cikage tet gaila. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Kedanemene kering gage ngngwa gaibeu kela herieki de au nrum nah lampui de au tet keherei, nah cide ngaulu kelame au mina kecam nage.<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsingbang ge nah pe tsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />Kenret caihakecimedung dade mriaklu, meurün paini kailu eh nnui da gwangla, dede helung lebie de au, penui au tuiketyei heneudung.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 22:27">Eze. 22:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Nnui penuide penui tsidung gade cilu zie. Mina hetubang gade kubetsi railu lani, mede hetubang gade tangzüttsi railu lani? <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Cinzwa eh, tsingbang keyi leune petsi keyi bui lula, dede tsingbang kesiabe petsi kesia bui beula. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Tsingbang keyi ge petsi kesia bui gailak, mede tsingbang kesiabe petsi keyi bui gailak. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Tsingbang petsi keyi builu kemakpe leune bi kaudi eh mi gage kelien gai dila. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Cine, nnui penuide penui tsidung gade ci luzie. <verse eid="MAT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />A cule, ‘Rampaubo, Rampaubo,’ de rang kelame leune tinggim hegwangram ga nlüt gailak, dede tinggim ga kebam a Pei lungning teilu kelame rünne zie. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Mina kekiee ge cipaunai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Cipaunai: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tutiak tingba de rangbam, cidau Tinggwang pelane de tiak zie kideu ga penui teikegai rehi gade.</char></note> a dage rangzie, ‘Rampaubo, Rampaubo, anui nzi gade caihakecisam rang meni, nah n zi gade herakesiadung de gwa meni, nah n zi gade miswakegah bata kekiee tei meni?’ <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Cidau Ih penui dage rang zie, ‘Ih nnuide madau gede cima! A dade mbai dilu, nnui kesiata tei kelamedung!’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 13:27">Luk. 13:27</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiketei kemriak nah kemieme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />“Ciziemne, keheibe de a sam aidungde siulu delwe tei mzai kelame au makecime ge tsura reu gage pe ki tei kelume ge nzwa da. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Tingrui hung, nah duidi gwang nah tingkai gui gwang delwe ki cide de samlwa, dede cide kau dima, kedanemene cide tsura reu gage tei kelune. <verse eid="MAT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />Dede keheibe de a sam aidungde siulu delwe cidungde tei mzai kemakme au kemieme ge heciangreu gage pe ki tei kelube nzwa da. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Tingrui hung, nah duidi gwang, nah tingkaidung gui gwang delwe ki cide de sam, nah cide kaudi, nah cide kengkap au dizu.”<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Jisu sam aidung de rang cang luge, maadidung pe keledeu sam de ziemne penui swa gahdi, <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />kedanemene pa penuide kengkieng teu kebamme nzwa, nah penui laisiukecime nzwa mene ledeu kecune.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s">Kempame ge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Jisu kideutu gade nghung luge, mina maadi ge pecai sui ladi. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Cidau, kempame ge peda gwang nah pe dwaga koktungmie ranggai, “Rampaubo, nang nsui lie cai, nang acu teimci lubui.” <verse eid="MAT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Jisu pe ba ketwa mpet pecu deugai eh ranggai, “Ih a lungning da. Mci lu.” Ge zette pa pempa de gade mcilu. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Ge Jisu pe dage rangdi, “Nang mige dage de ranglia so. Dede mie delwe nkatei npum cingkube de pung lialu nah ratakdung Moses ne rang kebeude teilu, penui ziemne zierang ge kerane.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:2-32">Lev. 14:2-32</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Haireukedibe kenlum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Jisu Capernaum<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Capernaum: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aide Galilee Jaaidi tingpeu lebie tu kebam namceu ge.</char></note> ga lüt luge, haireukedime ge pe da gwang eh pe dade kiegai, <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />nah rang eh “Rampaubo, a kilabe mnoi nah teeisüt eh kilung ga zeu zeulie.” <verse eid="MAT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Jisu pe dage rangdi, “Ih gwang delwe pecu teingkei beuzie.” <verse eid="MAT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Dede haireukedibe pe sam keligai eh rangdi, “Rampaubo, Ih ncu peu a kikang ga lüt kera duilie, dede nang sambe rünne ranggai lo, iciude a kilabe yilu zie. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Kedanemene Ih de kengkieng kangga kebamme ge, nah Ih a kangga reugwamedung bam. Ih aipaude de, ‘Tetti,’ dege pa tet dila, nah kedabe de, ‘Gwang,’ dege pa gwang dila, nah a kilabe de, ‘Aide teigai,’ de ge pa tei beula.” <verse eid="MAT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Dede Jisu aide siu luge, pa pe macang eh pecai sui kelame dage rangdi, “Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, Israel ga pe kenlum kedi migede aipaude kenzwa ngau mereu. <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />Dede Ih nnui dage ranggai la, mina kekiee naimiak kepetle nah naimiak kenlütle de gwangzie, nah penui tinggim hegwangram ga Abraham, Isaac, nah Jacob de ngngwa bamzie. <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />Dede hegwangram name dungde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hegwangram name dungde: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jewme</char></note> au hegwale kemui gage kelien gai dizie, cikade hap nah geigim bam dizie.” <verse eid="MAT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Pecai Jisu haireukedibe dage rangdi, “Tetcu! Nah nang nlumkelu nzwa, peu n ziemne teicang kelube tei lulo.” Nah pe kilapei cipau bamdakkak dau yilu.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu mina kekiee ge de teingkeikebeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Pecai Jisu Peter ki ga gwang keludau, pa Peter nau pui mra eh zeu kebam ngaulu. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Jisu pe ba tunggai, ge pa mrata di. Nah pa cuhlu delwe pe gwatei cuhdi. <verse eid="MAT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Tinghegi gwang ge, minadung herakesiabe ne ngngwa teu kelame kekiee ge de Jisu da ngngwa gwang. Pa cipau rabedungde de pe sam le mpetdi nah mateei kela leude teingkei beu. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />Ainzwa eh Isaiah caihakecibe ne sam rangkenzeu de, “Pa ne anui mateeidung luulu nah anui mateeidung pung luda,” de kecude teicanglu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:24">1 Pet. 2:24</ref></char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:4">Isa. 53:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Jisu maadi ge pecu twagwa kebam ngau luge, Pa Galilee jaai keda lebie gim ge tetgai kera pa ledeukelume dage sam kaibeu. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Ge laisiukecime ge peda gwang eh rangdi, “Keledeubo, nang keheiga mie liede Ih n caisui zielie.” <verse eid="MAT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Jisu pe dage rangdi, “Maiserung de pe ki bam, nah tingkam ruinedung de peciep bam, dede Mina Nabe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mina Nabe: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mina Nabe aide Jisu de rangbam da, pa au mina nzwa eh gwang, “Mina Nabe” aipau sam de Jisu au messaih de kecu saulia nah pa au mina kesang delie kecu. (Jn 1:14, 1 Jn 4:2)</char></note> au pe peu kaizeu kera ni de gah lie.” <verse eid="MAT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Pe caisuime kedage pe dage rangdi, “Rampaubo, acu peu keraibe gwang delwe a peide kungdi railo.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:20">1 Heg. 19:20</ref>,<ref loc="1KI 19:21">21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Dede Jisu pe dage rangdi, “A caisuilu, nah ketsaime de peu penuikatei penui paau kung kera püt zeudi.”<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu rahang kaamkedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Pa liem ga nlüt luge, pa ledeukelume de pecai sui nlütlu. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Ainie, jaaidi ga rahang kedi ge cuhdi, iciu eh liembe dui nswak ne gum puipung ladi. Dede Jisu au ziep zeu. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Ge ledeukelume pe da gwang eh pecu ngkia, ranggai, “Anuide kelibeu lo, Rampaubo; anui tsaidi lauda!” <verse eid="MAT 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />Jisu penui dage rangdi, “Daitei nnui ngngi lano, nnui kenlum kecamnadung?” Iciu eh pa cuhlu delwe tingkai nah jaaidi de kesiugai. Ge ngkaam zingdi. <verse eid="MAT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Dede minadung penui macangdi eh hangge ge dage rangdi, “Mina aipaude daikenzwa kauge no ai, tingkai nah jaaidi kecang de pesam mzai kecu?”<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Herakesia ngngwa kela hangna de teingkeikebeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Jisu keda lambie, Gadara deudi ga gwang luge, herakesia ne ngngwa kela mina hangna pecu redaulu. Penai heraudung gade mpetla nah penai zai sia sütla, cine migede cipau lampui ga tetkah luma. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Ainie, penai sahbak eh, rang eh ranggai, “Tinggwang Nabo, anai ncu ngngwa daipai tei laino? Nang peting cang kemakne anaide teikeherei kera aika gwang lani?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 4:34">Luk. 4:34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Cidau hebak hau maadi ge cika mapeei tyeila, penui dade ndei süt kemak gega. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Herakesiabedung Jisu dade kie eh ranggai, “Nang anuide gwa mpet ziecai, anuide lang pwa hebak hau gage kai dilo.” <verse eid="MAT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Ge Jisu penui dage ranggai, “Tetdi!” Cine herakesiadung mpetdi nah hebakdung da miedi; nah ainie, hebak hau pelane hetialwa gade rejaai ga pak reniamie eh penui dui gade tsaidi. <verse eid="MAT 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Dede hebak kekwamebau pak pwa namdi ga gwanglu delwe ma pelane paubeu, nah herakesia ne ngngwa teu kelabe kenade da daipai tei dibi kecu de si eh paubeu. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Ainie, renam gade mina pelane Jisu de redau kera gwang. Penui pecu ngau luge, penui pecu penui cuikui gade tetdi lo kie bidi.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s">Jisu kemnoime ge de teingkeikebeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Pecai Jisu liem ga nlütlu delwe kahpet pe katei pe nam ga gwangdi. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Ainie, penui kemnoime gede perak gage kailwe peda ngngwa gwang. Jisu penui kenlum ngau kegaidau, pa kemnoibe dage rangdi, “A napei, n suiyi lulo. N mau gibeudi delie.” <verse eid="MAT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Ge ainie, hezai keledeume kangge penuikatei penui kakgade rangdi, “Aipau peide Tinggwang de rangmsia zeu da.” <verse eid="MAT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Dede Jisu penui lungcet cilu eh rangdi, “Dai ziemne nnui lung gade nnui makesia mning lano? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Dai paube rang laki no, ‘N mau gibeu dida,’ de kecube mi, ‘cuhlu eh tetlu,’ de kecube no? <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Dede Mina Nabe kideu ga mina mau gibeulu kebui kengkieng kebam peu nnuide cilu kerane,” pecai pa kemnoibe dage rangdi, “Cuhlu, nzeu pwalu, delwe n kilung ga gwang culo.” <verse eid="MAT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Ge minabe cuhlu delwe pe kiga gwangdi. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Mina maadibe aide ngau luge, penui swagahdi nah Tinggwang, kengkieng cikenzwa mina de kepeube de twadi. <verse eid="MAT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Jisu cikade tetpet keladau, pa mige Mathew<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mathew: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pekie “RAMPAUBE mapeu”, pa au Levime nah heraha ha kelame ge. </char></note> lie qukela peige, heraha keha diki ga bam eh ngau. Pa pe dage rangdi, “Acai sui lu.” Nah pa cuhlu delwe pecai suidi.<verse eid="MAT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Pecai Jisu kilung ga matyei zielie eh lüt bam luge, ainie, heraha kehame nah kemau keteime kekieege de gwang eh Jisu nah pa ledeukelume de ngngwa matyei. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Phariseeme kangge cide kengau luge, pa ledeukelume dage penui rangdi, “Daitei nnui keledeube heraha kehame nah kemaumedung de ngngwa matyei lano?” <verse eid="MAT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Jisu aide siu luge, pa rangdi, “Mina pe pum kengkingme daru kecime de teu maisia ma, dede keteei keneime rünne teu maisia. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Dede nnui mie delwe aipau kiede ci lulo: ‘Ih ratak swade kekube luuneu lie.’ Kedanemene Ih samsang kelamede qu zielie gwang ma, dede kemaume de qu zielie gwang.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 6:6">Hos. 6:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu kemmwang ha ledeukecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Ge John caisuimedung pe da gwang eh rangdi, “Daitei eh anui nah Phariseemedung mmwang eh bamla, dede nang ne ledeukelume mmwang la meno?” <verse eid="MAT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Jisu penui sam keligai, “Meunui ngyi ga kebamme lakciube penui ngngwa kebam dau penui lung sia bam lubui ni? Dede lakciube de penui dade ngngwa tedi kera tingba ge gwang zie, nah pecaine penui mmwang zie. <verse eid="MAT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />Migede paici pwa pai kehegwa gage kopgai lama, kedanemene kop kegai dene paibe teurak dizie, nah hakmsiaki dizie. <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Mede migede zauci pwa teigeula kehegwa gage kai lama. Ciciu cai, teigeu de popdi zie, nah zaube tangra dizie, nah teigeula teimsia dizie. Meliene, penui zauci pwa teigeula keheci gage kaila, nah kenana de kwak lula.”<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Relei tsaikedi ge nah mateeikela pui ge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Pa ma aidungde penui dage rang kebamdau, ainie, synagogue kedime ge gwang eh pe da keumie. Pa rangdi, “A napui cune tsai dida, dede nang gwang eh n ba hwapwa pe dage kaigai lo, iciude pa ring luzie.” <verse eid="MAT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Ge Jisu cuhlu delwe pecai suidi, nah pa ledeukelume de pecu ngngwa tetdi. <verse eid="MAT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Ainie, mipui ge mmi kereiekena ge hejai eh kehereila kedi puige Jisu caile gwang eh pe pairi tung gai. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:36">Mat. 14:36</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />Kedanemene pa pekatei rang eh, “Magade Ih pe pai tunglu liecai, acu teimmi lubui.” <verse eid="MAT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Jisu nreugwang eh pecu ngau luge, rangdi, “A napoi, n suiyilu; n kenlum ne ncu tei mmilu delie.” Nah cipau ting siakdau mipuibe yingkeilu. <verse eid="MAT 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Jisu synagogue muiteube ki ga gwangcang luge, terwaine kwakebammedung nah hemaabe mbum kebam ngaulu. <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />Pa rangdi, “Tet dilu, releipui tsai ma, dede pa au ziep bam.” Dede penui pecu teu henuitei eh nuidi. <verse eid="MAT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Maadibe de peu hegwale mpetdi ge, pa kibung ga lüt nah releipui ba teugai, nah releipui cuhlu. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Aipau ha de cipau cuikui pelane ga rang popbak ladi.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu miakcitme nah ranglukemak gede teingkei kebeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Jisu cikade tetkah pet ge, miakcitme hangna pecu suigwang. Penai sahbak eh, rangdi, “David napei, anaide ngaunggia gailo.” <verse eid="MAT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Pa kilung ga nlüt luge, miakcitme kenade peda gwang. Jisu penai dage rangdi, “Ih aide teilu kebui nnai nlum lani?” Penai pe dage keligai, “Yeo, Rampaubo.” <verse eid="MAT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Ge pa penai miak deugai eh rangdi, “Nnai nlum kebam nzwa peu nnai da teigai lulo.” <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />Nah penai miak mraklu. Ge Jisu penai dage rang mtingsüt eh ranggai, “Aide peu migede de ci helo.” <verse eid="MAT 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Dede penai mpetlu nah aipau ha de cipau cuikui pelane ga rangrwa ladi.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Cipau pei kenade tetti zeu ge, ainie, maranglu kemakbe pei herakesiabe ne ngngwa kela gede pe da ngngwa gwang. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Herakesiabe de gwa mpetdi ge, pe let kegahbe de maranglu. Maadibe penui macang eh, rangdi, “Madaude Israel ga aikenzwa ngau mereu!” <verse eid="MAT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Dede Phariseemedung rangdi, “Herakesiabe kedibe kengkieng gade, pa herakesiadung de gwa mpetla.”<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hetaketeime camreu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Jisu namdidung nah renamdung leune ga mie. Pa penui synagoguedung<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:35 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Synagogue: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jewme recaki.</char></note> gade mide ledeu jüja eh hegwangram samliakeyi rangpwa mide lia, nah keteeikenei leu nah rapia leu teingkeibeu. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />Pa mina maadidung de ngau luge, pa penuide pelung siadi, kedanemene meuründung kekwabe kegah nzwa eh, penui penui lung keherei nah kengha kegahne.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:17">1 Heg. 22:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Pecai pa ledeukelume dage pa rangdi, “Luhlüt kera kieesüt, dede heta tei kerame au cam. <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Ciziemne luhlüt mpaube dade kie mzet lulo, iciude pa heta keteime de luhlüt kera langgai beulu kerane.”<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s">Jisu kereiekena de langmpet kegai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Jisu pa ledeukelume kereiekena de qu hekwalu delwe mcikemak rabe de gwa mpetlu kebui nah keteei keneime leude teingkeilu kebui kengkieng pwa penuide peu. <verse eid="MAT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Langkegaime kereiekena zi cai aidungde. Raitube Simon (pecu Peter de qula) nah pe caihereibe Andrew, Zebedee napei James, nah pe caihereibe John; <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />Philip nah Bartholomew; Thomas, nah heraha kehabe Matthew; Alphaeus napei James nah Thaddaeus; <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />Simon Zealot, nah Judas Iscariot, pecai pecu tuigai beu kerabe.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Jisu kereiekena aidungde de sam aidungde rang eh lang mpetgai, “Gentileme lampui ga mie so nah Samariame nam ket gade lüt so.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 50:6">Jer. 50:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />Meliene Israelme gah kedi meurünnadung da mielo. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Nah nnui kemie dau, ‘Tinggim hegwangram gwang nna ladi delie,’ de ledeu eh ranglo. <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Keteeikeneime de teingkei lu, ketsaime de kwakcuh lu, kempame de teimci lu, herakesiabe de gwa dilu. Nnui mta ngau kelunzwa mta peu lulo. <verse eid="MAT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />Nnui rangkang bung gage kecak, rangkanggeu mede hetageu peusa pung so. <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />Nnui beuh ziemne langsung, mede mcwa kena, picum mede hetui aidungde teuso, kedanemene maketeime pepok ngau tyei builu. <verse eid="MAT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />Nnui renam mede namdi keheiga kelütdau, petau tei kebambe de peeilu, nah nnui tetdai kemaktane cika bamlu. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Nnui kiga kelüt dau, ‘Nnui da peu lungciep bam lulo,’ de kelum lu. <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Magade cipau kelak de petau teicai, nnui lungciep de peu bamlu. Dede petau meliecai, nnui lungciep depeu nnuida cailigwang dilu. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Namdi mede kelak nnuide ngngwa ma nah nnui sam kingnei mecai, nnui cikade tet kempet dau, nnui pi gade rebui de kecung dilo. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, hetuketiak benai cipau namdi de swade Sodom penai Gomorrah lialu yiki zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19">Ken. 19</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />Ainie, Ih nnuide meurün de heneudung kak gage lang kegai nzwa langgaila, cine heneidung kemriak nzwa mriaklu nah tamhaudung kenciep nzwa ncieplu. <verse eid="MAT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Mina dade mriak lulo, kedanemene penui nnuide baudibedung dage tuigai zie, nah penui nnuide synagoguedung gade dap zielu. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Pecai nnuide deuceudidung nah hegwangmedung dwaga a ziemne ngngwa gwang zie, penui dage nah Gentileme dage zierang teilu kerane. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Penui nnuide tui kegai dau, daipai rang ziebi mede dainzwa rang ziebi cetpwa nnui lung pang so, kedanemene cipau bamdakkak de gwang de daipai rang ziebi nnuide peu zielu. <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />Kedanemene nnui ne cide rang lak, dede Pei Rabe ne nnui lung gade rang zie. <verse eid="MAT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />Caihereiswacing hangge ge de ketsai gage keretuigai zie, nah pe pei pe na de cinzwa zie. Henamedung penui puipei de renia cuh delwe penuide teitset dizie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 7:6">Mic. 7:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />A zi ziemne mina leune nnuide ngkau zie. Dede penli kecang lia kelume de kelibeu zie. <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />Penui aipau namdi ga nnuide teikeherei cai, keda nam gage pak gailu. Ih nnui dage rangsiakte gaila, Mina Nabe kegwang dwa Israel namdi pelane ga nnui gwang cang gailak.<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />Ledeukelume au keledeube swa diki ma, mede kilame ge pe mpaube reu ma. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Ledeukelume keledeube nzwa lucai mnunglu de yi nah kilame ge pe mpaube nzwa lucai mnunglu de yi. Magade penui kilung mpaube de Beelzebul<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Beelzebul: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Satan </char></note> lie qucai, pe kilung peupeime de daikenzwa gede siaki eh qu zieno! <verse eid="MAT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />Cine penuide hing so, kedanemene magede liagai kelak gumpwa kenzeu gah, nah magede ndugai kelak kebaipwa kebam gah. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Ih kemui gade nnui dage kerangdung de kebaa gade ranglia lulo, nah nnui kwen gade siu keludung de kipeu reu gade sahgai lulo. <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />Mipumbe de teitsetdi liede mi keringria de teitset gai kelakme de hing so. Meliene, mipumbe nah mikeringria kenana de pwa mijaai gage ngkaplu kebuibe de hing lulo. <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />Tangkine kena de peusa pakge le zwa la meni? Iciude nnui Pei ci mene kette hangdeu cak miedi lama. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Dede nnui peu ga tamleidung kecang de peikap luda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:7">Luk. 12:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Ciziemne hing helo, nnui tangkine kekiee ge swa pemi whungki lu. <verse eid="MAT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />Cine keheibede mina dwa de Ih Tinggwang nah Rampaube lie rang cai, Ih de tinggim kebam a Pei dwa de pe zierang rang zie. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />Dede keheibe de mina dwade acu mlai cai, Ih de tinggim kebam a Pei dwa de pecu mlai dizie.<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />Ih kideu ga kezuyi teu gwang kerane gwang lie kecu cet so. Ih kezuyi teugwang kerane gwang ma, dede kiengtie. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Kedanemene Ih peu pe napei de pe pei de renia, nah pe napui de pe pui de renia nah pe na nau de penai de renia kerane gwanglie. <verse eid="MAT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />Nah mige ngauraumedung au pekatei pe kelakmedung dizie. <verse eid="MAT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />Keheibe de acu swa pe pui pe pei de hungki dicai a caisuime teidui; nah keheibe de acu swa pe napui pe napei de hungki dicai a caisui teidui.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 14:26">Luk. 14:26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />Keheibe de pe cross pwa mene a caisui lacai a caisuime teidui. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Keheibe de pe teilung kainzeu lu keneume tei nggah dizie. Dede keheibe de a ziemne pe teilung ngkap kedime cide ngau luzie.<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />Keheibe de nnuide ngngwa kelube acude ngngwa lula, nah keheibe de acu ngngwa kelube acu lang kegaibe de de ngngwa lula. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Keheibe de caihakecime de, pa caihakecime lu de ngngwa lucai, caihakecime ziehi ngau luzie, nah keheibede makesangme de, pa makesangme lu de ngngwa lucai, makesangme ziehi nzwa ngau luzie. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Mina keheibe de, keceu aidung hangge de ledeukelume lu de a zi gade duikung piak nage de sak kera pwa peucai, Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, pa pe ziehi gah dilak lie.”<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s">Jisu nah Duipumketeibe John</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Jisu ledeukelume kereiekena bau dage maranglia cangdi ge, pa Galilee namdung ga mide ledeu nah zierang tei kerane cikade tetti. <verse eid="MAT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Duipumketeibe John hebaangki gade Khrista heta ketei ha siu luge, pa pe caisuimedung dage sam langgai, <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />nah pe dage rangdi, “Gwang zielie kelabede nang deni, mi anui kedage de peei maisia reu no?” <verse eid="MAT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Jisu penui sam keli eh rangdi, “Mie delwe John dage nnui kengaube nah kesiube ranglia lulo. <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />Miakcitme mangaulu bam dida, pepi kesiame tetlu bam dida, kempame mcilu bam dida, kwenpangme siulu bam dida, ketsaime ringdailu bam dida, nah kegahme dage samliakeyibe ledeu bam dida. <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Mina keheibe de a ziemne kaudi kemakme samlam pungtu.”<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Mina cidungde penui lampui gage tetgai dige, Jisu hemaadung dage John ha ranglia cuhdi, “Nnui daipai ge pie zielie hetaideu ga pet no? Tingkai ne gui kelai kebam herwabang ge ni? <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Dede daipai pie zielie nnui pet no? Mina kenciep paini keteume de ni? Ainie, kenciep paini keteume au hegwang kidung ga lunghla. <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Dede nnui daipai pie zielie pet no, caihakecime deni? Yeo, Ih nnui dage rangla, caihakecime swade kedi ge de. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />Pe ha aiciu eh raupwa la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 11:10">‘Pielo, Ih n dwaga a samgwabe de langgai beu zie, pa n dwa n lampui mtei beuzie.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal. 3:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />Ih nnui dage rangsiakte gaila, mipui dade lungh kegwang kakgade duipumketeibe John swa migede kedi ge de lungh cuh mereu. Dede tinggim hegwangram ga au ceutube de peswa diki.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Peswa di: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tinggim ga ceutube au digwa kideu aide ga ditube swade.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Duipumketeibe John ting gade cu kecang tinggim hegwangram kehereisüt la dida, mina pezai kesiame cide süt teudi kera tei. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Kedanemene John ting kecang caihakecime pelane nah hezaibe caihakecisam rang gwang. <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Nah magade nnui cide luulu zie liecai, pa au Elijah gwang kerabe de delie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mal. 4:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Keheibe de masiu kera pe kwen kebamme de peu pecu siu lulo. <verse eid="MAT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />Ih daipai le teu ceheu aide de keda laino? Penui au henamedung litak ni ga bamlwe hangge ge de qulu eh, <verse eid="MAT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />‘Anui nnui ziemne terwaine kwa beuda, dede nnui lim ma. Anui ketsai nggia da, dede nnui au hap ma,’ de eh kerang nzwa delie. <verse eid="MAT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Kedanemene John tyei mede sak eh gwang ma, nah penui, ‘Pe da herakesia ge la,’ de eh rangdi. <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Mina Nabe tyei nah sak eh gwang, nah penui, ‘Pielo, pa au matyei keneukau, nah sak kemie kau, heraha kehame nah kemau keteime zangbe!’ De eh rangdi. Dede maci au pe name dade peu mide pecu ci lula.”<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Helung nreukemak namdidung keherei kera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Pecai Jisu pa miswakegah batadung kekiee tei kegai namdidung de kesiu cuhdi, kedanemene penui lung nreulu kemakne. <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />“Ainie, Chorazin!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Chorazin: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jisu zierang teisüt kegai namdi kecum gade ket da namdi aide.</char></note> Ainie, Bethsaida! Magade nnui dage miswakegah bata tei kegai de Tyre penai Sidon nam gage teigai liecai, penui ndaa ge rosopai nah mimangbüt teu eh penui lung nreu zie de nage. <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Dede Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, hetuketiak benai Tyre penai Sidon au nnui swade lialu yiki zie. <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />Nang Capernaum ncu teu cehu nghang tinggim tunglu buini? Ncu teu henah mie Hades gage kai dizie. Nnui dage miswakegah bata keteidung Sodom gade teigai cai, henai kecangde cide bam zie reu nage. <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Dede Ih nnui dage ranglia zie, hetuketiak benai nnui ziemne swade Sodom deu ga kelungme be lialu yiki zie.”<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Leukelame ziemne kemtak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Cipau tingdau Jisu samkeli eh rangdi, “A Pei, tinggim nah kideu Rampaubo, nang makecime nah makecetme dade sam aidungde kebai pwala eh hena keceu dage keulia kegaine Ih ncu twala. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Yeo, Peibo, kedanemene cide au n miakngau gade pe tausüt kecune. <verse eid="MAT 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />Maleune de a Pei ne acu nlum beu dida; nah a Pei rünne gwale migede Nabe de ci lama, nah Nabe rünne gwale migede Peibe de ci lama, nah keheibe de Nabe pecu liagai kera kedet kelume gwale. <verse eid="MAT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />Ada gwanglu, nnui matei mri nah hepüt kerüt pung kela leune, nah Ih nnuide kemtak pwapeu zie. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />A ngwanggai keu punglu nah a dade macilu, kedanemene Ih au nciep nah a mlung henah kecune, iciude nnui nnui keringria ziemne kemtak ngau luzie. <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Kedanemene a ngwanggai au pung relui nah a püt au mca kecune.”<verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s">Sabbath Rampaube</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />Cipau tingdau Sabbath benai Jisu nah pa ledeukelume luhdung tetkah gwang. Nah pa ledeukelume mzeu di eh hereibui nriep cuhdi delwe cidungde tyei ladi. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Dede Phariseeme cide ngau luge, penui Jisu dage rangdi, “Pielo nang ledeukelume hezai kemakbe Sabbath benai teila dida.” <verse eid="MAT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />Dede Jisu penui dage rangdi, “Pa nah pecu ngngwa kelame mzeu kedi dau, David daipai tei bi kecu nnui madaude Kesanglaisiu gade pei meni?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Samuel 21:1-6</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Pa Tinggwang kiga lütlwe tangku reca tei kedi de tyei, cide pa nah pecu ngngwa kelame tyei kera hezai ma, dede cingkume rünsangne tyei lubui. <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Mede cingkumedung kerecaki gade Sabbath benai Sabbath zai gikah liede penui maudi la kemak nnui hezai gade pei meni? <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />Dede Ih nnui dage ranggai la, kerecaki swa de diki kecu ge aika bam. <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Nnui, ‘Ih ratakbe mene ngaugiabe luuneu lie,’ kecu aipau kiede cilie cai, nnui kemau kegahme de mmau lak nage.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 6:6">Hos. 6:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />Kedanemene Mina Nabe au Sabbath Rampaube kecune.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 2:28">Mrk. 2:28</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Ge Jisu cikade tetpwa penui synagogue ga lütdi. <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />Ainie, cika mige peba tsai kedi ge bam. Phariseemedung, Jisu de keteu eh ranggai, “Sabbath benai mide teingkei kecu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sabbath benai mide teingkei kecu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sabbath aide mtakkak ga tingbazie lang henane benai. Jewme heta leune gade aipau nai kemtak mneila. </char></note> hezai mi meno?” Iciu eh penui pecu mmau kerane. <verse eid="MAT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Jisu penui dage rangdi, “Nnui kakga caube, magade pe meurün ket rünne bam eh Sabbath benai aipau meurün de hekwa kecuk ga cakmie dicai, cide heraklu delwe teu mpet kelak bam no? <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Ciciu cai, mina au meurün swa de daikenzwa gede pemi whung ki no! Ciziemne Sabbath benai makeyi ketei au hezai lie.” <verse eid="MAT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Ge Jisu minabe dage rangdi, “N ba nzang pet gailo.” Ge pa pe ba nzang petgai, nah keda lebie ba nzwa cide yi dailu. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Dede Phariseemedung hegwale mpetlu delwe dainzwa eh penui Jisu de teitset lubui bi kecu ciem riemdi.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tinggwang kedetkelu kilabe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Jisu cipau ciem de ci luge, pa cikade tetdi. Mina kekie pecaisui ladi, nah pa penui pelane de teingkeibeu. <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />Peu migede de peu pe ha ci helo pa penuide aja kaigai, <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />iciu eh caihakecibe Isaiah dage rang kegai de teicanglu kerane:<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />“Pielo, a kilabe Ih ne kedet kelube,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">akube, a keringria de pecu pe suiyi kelabe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">Ih a Rabe pereu gage kaigai zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">nah pa Gentileme dage tutiak recilia zie.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />Pa au renia mede sah nrung lak,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:19">mede puidikidung gade de migede pekwa siulak.<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />Pa herwabang pang kebamde de teicum dilak,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">pa miheu kebam de tei mmüt dilak,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">pa kesangbe de peu ngkienglu kemaktane, <verse eid="MAT 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />nah pezi ga Gentileme keregui bam luzie.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isaiah 42.1-4.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu nah Beelzebul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Ge mige herakesia ne ngngwakela pemiakcit nah pelet kegah gede ngngwa Jisu da gwang. Pa cipau dede teingkeibeu, iciu eh pelet kegahbe de maranglu nah ngaulu. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Hemaabe pelane penui macang eh rangdi, “Aipaude David napei meni?” <verse eid="MAT 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Dede Phariseemedung aide siu luge, penui rangdi, “Mina aipaude herakesiadung de gwa gailak, herakesia kedibe Beelzebul<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Beelzebul: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Satan </char></note> kengkieng gade gwale.” <verse eid="MAT 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Dede Jisu penui lungcet cilu eh penuide rangdi, “Hegwangram leune de penuikatei penui kakga ngngwa sia kedibe mtamrwa dizie, nah namdi leune mede kelak keheibe de penuikatei penui kakga ngngwa sia kedibe sap gailak. <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Magade Satan ne Satan de gwa mpet cai, pa pekatei pecu regi dida. Iciu cai dainzwa pe hegwangram saplu lai? <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Nah magade Ih Beelzebul kengkieng gade herakesiabe de gwa mpet cai, nnui namedungbe caube kengkieng gade penuide gwa mpet laino? Aipau kiede ziemne penui ne nnui tutiakbe teizie. <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Dede magade Ih Tinggwang Rabe teu eh herakesiabe de gwa mpet cai, iciu cai Tinggwang hegwangram nnui reu gwangbam dida. <verse eid="MAT 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />Mede mige kengkiengme gede kangrai di mene dainzwa pe kiga lüt delwe pe guniadung regalu laino? Ciciu kelu caine pa pe guniadung pe ki gade rega lubui. <verse eid="MAT 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />Keheibe de acu ngngwa kemakbe acu renia la, nah keheibe de acu ngngwa hekwala kemakbe teizangla dila. <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Cine Ih nnui dage ranggai la, kemau nah mide rangkemsia leune gi beuzie, dede Kemci Rabe de rang kemsia au gibeu lak. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Keheibe de Mina Nabe de sam kesia kerang au gibeu zie. Dede keheibe de Kemci Rabe de sam kesia kerang au gibeu lak, cude mede gwangkera mmi gade de. <verse eid="MAT 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />Tsingbang de ngkwet mmilu delwe peu pe tsi keyi builu, mede tsingbang de ngkwet msiadi delwe peu pe tsi kesia builu, kedanemene pe tsi gade pe bang de cilu lalu. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Nnui neidui leuhmedung, nnui kesiame delwe, dainzwa makeyi ranglu laino? Kedanemene milung ga ma kekiee kebam gade mimui rangpet lalu. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Mina keyime pe lung pe mabam keyi gade makeyi li mpetla, nah mina kesiame pelung pe mabam kesia gade makesiadung li mpet lalu. <verse eid="MAT 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />Ih nnui dage ranggai la, mina kemta sam kerang leune ziemne, penui tutiak benai cide rangdai kapzie. <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />Kedanemene n samdung gade nang mzeu de luzie nah n samdung gade ncu mmau de dizie.”<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jonah rehi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Laisiukecimedung ge nah Phariseeme Jisu sam keli eh, ranggai, “Keledeubo, anui n dade marehi ge ngauneu lalie.” <verse eid="MAT 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />Dede Jisu sam keli eh penui dage rangdi, “Kesia nah kemmha ceheu marehi ge peeila. Dede caihakecibe Jonah dage marehi tei kegai de gwale marehi keda gede pwapeu lakta. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Kedanemene Jonah tingbazie nah tingmuizie lang cumne heka kedi pok ga kebam nzwa, Mina Nabe de tingbazie nah tingmuizie lang cumne kideube lung ga bam zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jonah 1.17</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Tutiak benai Ninevehme ceheu aide de ngngwa sap zie nah cide de mmau zie. Kedanemene penui Jonah ne penui dage zierang tei kegai gade penuilung nreulu, nah pielo, Jonah swade mige digwa kecu ge aika bam. <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Tingbangle<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:42 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tingbangle: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Arabia tingbangle</char></note> Gwangpui<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:42 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tingbangle Gwangpui: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sheba ga hegwangpui (1 Heg. 10:1, 2 Hel. 9:1)</char></note> tutiak benai ceheu aide de ngngwa sap zie, nah cide de mmau zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Hegwangme 10.1-13; 2 Heleuhha 9.1-12.</char></note> Pa kideu penli gade Solomon maci siu zielie gwang, nah, ainie, mige Solomon swa digwa kecuge aika bam. <verse eid="MAT 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />“Mcikemak rabe mina dade mpet kedidau, dui kegahdung ga kahgwang eh mtak kera peeila, dede cide ngaulu tadi. <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />Ge cide rangdi, ‘Ih kegwang a kiga Ih cailigwang dizie.’ Pa cailigwang luge, ki cide mrwa nah biak mcidi nah pe bam gage kai pwabam eh ngaulu. <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />Ipaucai pa tetpet eh pe swa siaki kecu hera keda hena de ngngwagwang, nah penui pelane gwang cika lungh dila. Ge mina cipaude ndaa kerai dau swade kekam le sia reureu dila. Cudau ceheu kesia aide de cinzwa dizie.”<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu pui nah sinamedung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Jisu mina maadung dage marang kebamdau, ainie, pe pui nah pe caihereimedung hegwale sap eh pecu mpau zielie peeila. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Mikang ge pe dage rangdi, “Ainie, n pui nah n caihereimedung ncu mpau zielie peei eh hegwale sap bam lie.” <verse eid="MAT 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Dede Jisu pecu rang kegaibe sam keligai, “Cau a pui nah caudung ge a caihereime no?” <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Ge pa pe ba hwa pwa pe caisuime lamge kai eh rangdi, “Ainie, aidungde a pui nah a caihereimedung delie!” <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />Kedanemene tinggim ga kebam a Pei suibe tei kelame, cipaume a caihereime, a time nah a pui de kecune.”<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s">Hetaketabe samgwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Cipaunai Jisu kiga gade tetpet Galilee jaaidi kung ga bamlu. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Mina maadi ge ngkwalwe pecu twagwalu, cine pa liem gega lütlu delwe cika bamlu, cidau maadi pelane duikung ga saplu. <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />Ge pa ma kekiee ge penui de samgwa keda eh ranglia, “Ainie, hetaketame ge heleuh nrok zielie mie. <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Pa heleuh nrok gai ge, heleuh kesa lampui kungga cakmie di, nah nruinedung ne gwang cidungde pa tyeilu. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Keda leuhdung tsura reu, tangdei kiee kemak ga cakmiedi. Cidungde pwak zette cuhlu, kedanemene pedeu siu kemakne. <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />Dede tingnaimiak cuh luge, pe mah him ncuklu kemakne mabangdung de pu kidi. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Keda leuhdung hetu bangdung kakga cakmiedi. Hetu bangdung lungh cuhlu delwe cidungde de zin tsetdi. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Keda leuhdung tangdei keyi ga cakmielu eh petsi builu, kesa hai, kesa riakherok nah kesa camrei. <verse eid="MAT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Caugame pe kwen bambi, peu kingnei lulo.”<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Ledeukelumedung Jisu da gwang eh rangdi, “Daitei nang mina maadibe dage samgwa gade marang no?” <verse eid="MAT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Pa sam keli eh penui dage ranggai, “Nnui de tinggim hegwangram sam kecukdung de cilu kera peu dida, dede kedame de cide pwapeu ma. <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Keheibe de ma peda kebamme de peusi zie delwe peu pegu pui nlim luzie. Dede keheibede ma peda kegahbe, peda kebam nade de keuteu dizie. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Aide ziemne Ih penui dage samgwa gade marang bam: penui piebam de; penui ngau gailak, nah penui siubam de, penui siu ma, mede ci luma. <verse eid="MAT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />Caihakecibe Isaiah caihakecisam ainzwa kerangdung de penui da teicang luda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Isa. 6:9-10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">‘Nnui siu kesang zie, dede nnui ci gailak;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">nnui pie kesang zie, dede nnui ngau gailak.<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />Kedanemene mina aipaume lung mang dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">nah penui kwen tak dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">nah penui penui miak ziangmui dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">iciu mecai penui penui miak le mangau luzie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">mede penui kwen le masiu luzie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">mede penui mlung le macet ci luzie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">nah penui nreu caili gwang dai zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">nah Ih penuide teingkei beuzie.’<verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />Dede nnui miakdung nah kwendung samlam pungtu lie, penui ngau; nah siu kelane. <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />Ih nnui dage rangsiakte gaila, caihakecime kekiee ge nah makesangme kekiee ge nnui ma kengaudung de ngau neusüt, dede cidungde ngau luma. Nnui ma kesiudung de penui siu neusüt, nah cidungde siu luma. <verse eid="MAT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />Heta ketame pe leuh gi kegaibe samgwa de kingnei lulo. <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Keheibede hegwangram sam siulu dede cide cilu kemakme, kesiabe gwang eh pe lung ga linggai pwa kebam de sütteu dila. Aidungde heleuh nrok pwa lampuikung gage kai kedibe delie. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Heleuh nrok pwa tsura reu gage kai kedibe cai, sambe siulu delwe pe suiyi süt eh cide zette ngaulu kelube delie. <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />Dede pekatei pe mah him mielu kemakne peting kedui nage gwale penui bamlu lama. Sambe ziemne keherei mede teikeherei kecu kegwang dau, pa zette kaumie dila. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Hetu bang kakgage nrokgai keludung de cai, sambe siulu, dede teilung aide nah mabam kehengim ne sam aidungde zin nggahdi eh petsi builu tadi kedibe delie. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Heleuh nrokpwa pedeu keyi gage kaikelube au sam cide siu lwe pekie ci kelube delie. Pa pe tsi bui kesang lula. Kangge tsi hai kecang de builu, kangge riakherok nah kangge camrei bui lula.”<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tseheidung samgwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Jisu penui dage samgwa kedage ranglia dai. Pa rangdi, “Tinggim hegwangram au mige heleuh keyibe pe luh gage nrok kegai nzwa delie. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Dede mina ziep kezeu dau, pe ngauraume gwang eh reima leuh herei kakgage nrokgai di eh tetdi. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Cidungde pwaklu cuh eh pe tsi bui keludau, reimadungde lungh cuhlu. <verse eid="MAT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />Hangdeu mpaube kilame peda gwang eh rangdi, ‘Kedibo, nang heleuh keyibe n luh gage nrok gai meni? Dainzwa eh reima lungh dino?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />Pa penui dage rangdi, ‘A ngauraume ne aide tei gaida.’ Kilame pe dade rangdi, ‘Iciucai nang peu anuide mie cidungde pai mpetdi neuni?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />Dede mpaube rangdi, ‘Lak. Kedanemene nnui reimadung pai mpet keladau, nnui cidungde si eh wheat de pai dilu builu. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Peu penaide luhlüt kemaktane ngngwalung ncüt bamlu. Luhlüt ting daune Ih luh rumkelame dage rangzie, “Keraibe reimadung pai mpetlu eh cidungde kanglwe rudi, dede wheat de a bau gage hekwalu.”’”<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ziegitsi nah tsehi samgwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Jisu penui dage samgwa kedage ranglia dai. Pa rangdi, “Tinggim hegwangram au mige ziegitsi leuh teumie pe luh gage nrok kegai nzwa delie. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Kesang cide au heleuh pelane kakgade ceutuna ge. Dede cide lungcuh keludau, cide hegurie ga mabangdung swade di. Cide tsingbang tei lula, iciu eh ting ruinedung gwang pe kiakdung gage pe ciep teu lula.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Palestine ga ziegitsi leuh tsingbang nzwa lunghdi cuh eh nruinedung pekiak ga peciep teu lula.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Pecai Jisu penui dage samgwa kedage ranglia dai. “Tinggim hegwangram au mipui ge tsehi keulwe tokkui mdet kecum<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tokkui mdet kecum: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kilogram kecum kenzwage.</char></note> gage ruiza lu eh nggau cu kemaktane kaizeu kela nzwa delie.”<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Jisu ma aidungde pelane samregwa gade maadidung dage ranggai; nah pa samgwa teu mene penui dage magede rang ma. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />Aiciu kecu au caihakecibe dade kerang de teicanglu kerane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">“Ih a mui ngkeigai eh samgwa rangzie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">Kideu teikelu gade kebai teu keladung de Ih rangzie.”<verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cehidung samgwa rangmci kegai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Cidau pa maadidung de gidi eh kilung ga nlütdi. Pa ledeukelumedung peda gwang eh, ranggai, “Luh ga reimadung samgwade anui dage rangmci lialo.” <verse eid="MAT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Pa keligai eh rangdi, “Mige heleuh keyibe nrok kegaibe de au Mina Nabe delie.” <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />Heluh au kideube delie; nah heleuh keyibe cai, hegwangram namedung da. Reimabedung cai kesiabe namedung delie, <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />Nah ngauraube reima nrok kegaibe de au herakesiabe delie. Luhlüt ting au peting penli deda, nah luh rumkelame au tinggimgwame delie. <verse eid="MAT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />Ciziemne, reima hekwapwa mi gage ru kedi nzwa, peting penli dau de cinzwa zie. <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Mina Nabe pe gwamedung de langmpet gai zie, nah pe hegwangram gade penui kemau ketei pelane nah mina kesiata tei kelamedung de penui hekwa luzie. <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />Penuide kelien pwa mi heu kebam gage kai dizie, kehap nah geigim pung kebam ga. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Iciu de mina makesangme penui Pei hegwangram gade tingnaimiak nzwa baa dizie. Keheibe de pe kwen kebambe de peu kingnei lulo.<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pemikehungbe samgwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />Tinggim hegwangram au luh gage mahei kebai kenzeu nzwa delie, mige cide ngaulu eh kebaidi. Cipaude pe suiyi kedine, pa gwang delwe pegu kebam leune zwa ciaudi, delwe cipau luh de luilu. <verse eid="MAT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />Aipaucai de, tinggim hegwangram au mige heli keteime ge tsuga pemi kewhungdung peei kela nzwa da. <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />Pa tsuga ket pemi whungsüt kecu ge ngau keludau, pa pegu kebam leune zwalu eh mie cide luilu.<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Helang samgwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />Aipaucai de, tinggim hegwangram au mige helang ge kelien pwa jaaidi gage kai eh heka ketsamtsam hekwa kelu nzwa delie. <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />Cide pui luge, heka ketuimedung cide teumpet duikung gage kailu. Cidau penui bamlwe heka keyibe hekwa pwa mabungdung gage hekwalu, dede kesiabedung penui kelien gidi. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Kideu cangkedi benai aiciu dizie. Tinggimgwame gwang eh mina kesiame de makesangme kakgade keu ntsam dizie. <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />Penuide kelien pwa miheu kebam gage kai dizie, kehap nah geigim pung kebam ga.<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />Nnui ma aidungde pelane cilu deni? Ledeukelume keligai, “Yeo.” <verse eid="MAT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Ge Jisu penui dage rangdi, “Cine laisiukecime leune tinggim hegwangram caisuime teikelumedung au mige kilung mpaume ge pe mabambung gade makeheci penai kehegwa li mpet kecu nzwa delie.”<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Caihakecibe kerüt kegah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Pecai Jisu samgwa aidungde rangcang dige, pa heni cikade tetdi. <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />Ge Jisu pe nam, Nazareth ga gwang, nah penui gu synagogue gade mina de ledeu. Cide ngaulwe penui macang eh rangdi, “Aipau peide, pe maci aipaude nah miswakegah kengkieng bata aidungde daiga de ngaulu no? <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />Aipau pei de tsingta keteibe napei meni? Pepui Mary lie qu kelapui de meni? Pe caihereime James, Joseph, Simon nah Judas meni? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Pe time pelane de anuide ngngwa bam meni? Iciu cai pa dai gade aidungde pelane ngaulu dino?” <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Penui au pecu mlaidi. Dede Jisu penui dage rangdi, “Caihakecime de au pekatei pe ram ga nah pe kilungme gwale mi pecu rüt kemak gah.” <verse eid="MAT 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Pa cika miswakegah bata tei kiee ma penui nlumlu kemakne.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s">Duipumketeibe John peu dangkedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Cipau tingdau ge, Galilee cuikui reu kedibe Herod Jisu ha siulu. <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />Pa pe kangga kedime dage rangdi, “Aipaude Duipumketeibe John da; pa ketsai gade ringcuh dida. Ciziemne bata kengkieng aidungde peda heta teibam.” <verse eid="MAT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Kedanemene Herod John de tuilu, eh pecu kanglu delwe hebaangki gage pecu kaidi, pe caihereibe Philip nau Herodias ziemne. <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />Kedanemene ting kage John pe dage, “Cipau puide de n nau kera n ziemne hezai ma,” de eh rangbam kedine.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lev 18:16; 20.21</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Herod pecu teitsetdi neudi, dede pa minadungde hingdi, kedanemene penui pecu caihakecime gelie la kecune. <verse eid="MAT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Dede Herod de kemna tingba kegwangdau, Herodias napui hemaabe dwa de helim lim nah Herod suiyi teilu. <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />Ciziemne, pa kie kegai keheibe pa pecu peu zielie letpet eh sampet beudi. <verse eid="MAT 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Pecai pe pui ne rangkebeu nzwa, pa rangdi, “Duipumketeibe John peu hekwak gage kailwe aika acu peulo.” <verse eid="MAT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Hegwangpei pesui sia sütdi, dede pe sampet kedide ziemne nah pecu ngngwa matyei kebamme ziemne, pe sui tei beu lulo pa aja kai beudi. <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />Pa reugwame ge de langgai eh hebaangki gade John peu dangdi. <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />Ge pe peu hekwak gage kailwe pwagwang releipui de peu beu, nah pa cide pepui de pwagwang beudi. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Ge John caisuime gwang pe paau pwa tetdi, delwe cide kungdi. Aipau cai, penui mie delwe Jisu dage ranglia.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu mina cang mengei pukketei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Jisu aide siu luge, pa liem gade cikade tetpwa mina lungh kemak heni ga pekatei miedi. Maadibe cide siu luge, penui namdidung gade pile tet gwang pecai suidi. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Ge Jisu gwang eh maadibe de ngaulu. Pa penuide ngaunggiadi nah teeinei kelame de teingkeibeu. <verse eid="MAT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Tinghegi gwang kezeu dau, ledeukelumedung pe da gwang eh ranggai, “Aide au mina lungh kemak heni ge nah peting de riham dida. Cine maadidung de langgi dilo, iciu eh penui renam ga mie penui ziemne taktyei lui kerane.” <verse eid="MAT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Dede Jisu penui dade rangdi, “Penui tetdi mede yi. Nnui penuide matyei kera ma pwapeu lulo.” <verse eid="MAT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Penui pe dage rangdi, “Anui aika magede gah da tangku kwakmengei nah heka pumna rünne gwale.” <verse eid="MAT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Pa rangdi, “Cidungde aika acu teugwang beulo.” <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Ge Jisu maadibe de tsehei reu ga ntumbam lulo ranggai. Pa tangkukwak mengei nah heka pumna de pwalu. Tinggim ngangcuh piegai eh pa tangkukwakdung de samlam gai nah teipoplu delwe cidungde ledeukelumedung de peugai, nah ledeukelumedung cidungde maadibe de peubeu. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Penui pelane tyei nah nggei kaplu. Pecai penui taktyei tyeibang keludung hekwalu, hebie kereiekena puiting kecu. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Matyei kelume mina cangmengei kenzwa ge, hename nah mipui de si mene<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hename nah mipui de si mene: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jewme zai rehi gade mipei nah mipui hemaabe dwa de ngngwa matyei lama nah hename mipui de ngngwa matyei la, aide ziemne, Mathew mipei riak peu ci gai.</char></note>.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu duireu ketet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Jisu zette peu ledeukelumedung de liemga nlütlu, delwe jaaidi keda lebie pe dwa gwangnswa lulo beu, pa maadibe de langgi kebam dauge. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Pa maadibe de langgi kedi cai, pa kekie tei kerane kideutu reuga pekatei hangdi. Cidau tinghegi gwangdi, nah pa pekatei rünne cika bam. <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />Aipau tingdau liem de rejaai sum ga ladi, dui nswak gage pung nlim teu eh, kedanemene tingkai ne penuide guilwa bam kedine. <verse eid="MAT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Tingmui reket pe mdaibe tingdau<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Reket pe mdaibe: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jewme, nah Romme, tingmuiziu reketbe maa mdai tei eh mzigai bamla, bamdakkak kecum ge ge kecu, reket raitube bam herok dau ndeula nah reket pemdaibe bam cum dau ndeula.</char></note>, Jisu dui reu gade tet penuida gwang. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Ledeukelumedung pecu duireu ga tetkela ngau keludau, penui ngngi sütdi eh, “Cide au herabe geda,” de rangdi nah penui ngngi eh mradi. <verse eid="MAT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Dede Jisu zette penui dage maranggai, “Kuu lu! Ih lie! Ngngi diso.” <verse eid="MAT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Ge Peter ranggai, “Rampaubo, magade nang liecai, acu peu duireu gade tetpet nda gwang lulo samkai beulo.” <verse eid="MAT 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Jisu rangdi, “Mpetlu.” Cine Peter liem gade mpetlu nah Jisu da mie kerane duireu gade tetpet. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Dede Peter tingkai cisüt kecu de ngau luge, pa ngngidi. Pa nlim mie ge, pa sahbak eh, ranggai, “Rampaubo, acu kelibeu lo!” <verse eid="MAT 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Jisu zette pe ba hwapwa Peter de teulu delwe pedage rangdi, “Nang kenlum keceu nabo, daitei nang lunghau dino?” <verse eid="MAT 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Nah Jisu penai Peter liem ga nlüt luge, tingkai gui ngkaam zingdi. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Ge ledeukelume liem ga kelamedung Jisu de reca eh, rangdi, “Nang Tinggwang Nabe kesang da.”<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Penui cide kahgwang keludau, penui Gennesaret<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:34 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Gennesaret: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">renam aide Galilee Jaai tingpeu-naimiak kenlüt lebie bam.</char></note> deu ga gwanglu. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />Mina heni cika kebamme Jisu de ci luge, penui sam twagwapung kebam deu pelane gage kai langgai, nah penui keteeikenei leude peda ngngwa gwang. <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />Penui pe dade pe pairi peu tunglo eh kiedi, nah cide tung kelu leune yilu.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s">Mci nah mcakemakbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Cidau Phariseeme kangge nah laisiukecime Jerusalem gade Jisu da gwang. Penui keteu eh, <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />“Daitei eh n caisuimedung paupaime zaidung gikah lano? Penui maketyei dwa penui ba mtiak lama.” <verse eid="MAT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Pa penuide sam keligai, “Iciu cai nnuide daitei eh nnuikatei nnui zaidung ziemne Tinggwang aja de de gikah lano? <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Kedanemene Tinggwang aja kai kebeu, ‘N pui n pei de rütlu’ nah ‘Keheibe de pe pei mede pe pui de sam kesia rang cai, cipaude tsai bizie.’ <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Dede nnui rangla, ‘Keheibe de pepui mede pepei dage, “Nang a dade ngaulu kera kengha de cu au Tinggwang de peu kedi mapeu dida, de eh rangcai,”’ <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />pa pepei de rüt mede yida, dela. Ainzwa eh nnuikatei nnui zaidung ziemne Tinggwang<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kehegwa laisiu yitubedung ga </char><char style="fqa">Tinggwang sam de, </char> de eh bam la, nah kesa laisiu ga <char style="fqa">aja de, </char> de eh bamla.</note> sam de kemta tei dida. <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Nnui hezai teikelamedung! Isaiah nnui ha rang kenzeu de petaulie,<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />‘Mina aidungde penui muileudung le acu rütla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:8">dede penui mlung au a dade mdeila.<verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />Penui acu reca kela au kemta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:9">kedanemene penui mina ne tei kelu zaidung de pwa penui zaidung nzwa mide ledeu kelane.’”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isaiah 29:13</char></note><verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Ge pa maadibe de qupwa pe dage kailu eh penui dage rangdi, “Kingneilu nah ci lulo, <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />Magede mina mui ga kenlütbe mide teihera lama. Meliene, mimui gade kempetbe ne mide teihera dila.” <verse eid="MAT 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Ge pa ledeukelumedung gwang eh Jisu dage rangdi, “Phariseemedung sam aidungde siu luge penui lung siakedi nang ci meni?” <verse eid="MAT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Jisu keligai, “Tsingbang tinggim kebam a Pei ne linggai kemak leune paidi zie. <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />Peu cidungde de ciciu bamlu. Penui au miakcietme muiteume. Miakcietme ge keda miakcietme lampui saulia cai, hangnana de hekwaki ga cakmie dizie.” <verse eid="MAT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Peter pe dage rangdi, “Samgwa aide anui dage ranglia lo.” <verse eid="MAT 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Jisu rangdi, “Nnui de cude cilu mereu ni? <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />Keheibe de mimui ga kenlütbe mipuk ga gwang dila nah pecai mipum gade mpet dila kecu nnui ci meni? <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Dede mimui gade mpet keladung au mi mlung gade petla. Cidungde ne mide teihera dila. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Kedanemene milung gade lungcet kesia, dapketset, kemmha, kerega, kenret zierang ketei, nah mide rangkemsia petla kecune. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Ma aidungde ne mide teihera dila. Dede heba mtiak mene maketyei au mide tei heradi lama.”<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Canaanme pecu kenlum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Cipaucai Jisu cipau ni de gidi delwe tetpwa Tyre nah Sidon namdi cuikui lebie gwangdi. <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Canaanme puige cipau cuikui gade peda gwang. Pa sah eh rangdi, “Rampaubo, David Napei! Acu ngaunggia lo, a napui de herakesiabe ne keliang msiasüt la dida.” <verse eid="MAT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Dede Jisu pe dage sam gede rang ma. Ge pa ledeukelume pe da gwang eh kiegai, “Pecu lang gidi lo, pa anui caisui eh sahla di delu.” <verse eid="MAT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Dede Jisu pe sam keli eh ranggai, “Acu mige dage de langgai ma, Israel leuhme gahkedi meuründung dage gwale.” <verse eid="MAT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Dede mipuibe gwang pe dwa keumie eh ranggai, “Rampaubo, acu ngha gailo.” <verse eid="MAT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Pa keligai, “Hename<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:26 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hename: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aide Israelme de rangbam.</char></note> taktyei keulwe heteunadung de kelien pwapeu kedi petau ma.” <verse eid="MAT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Pa rangdi, “Yeo, Rampaubo, dede heteunadung de pempaume taktyeibam gade tangra kemiebe tyeila.” <verse eid="MAT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Ge Jisu pe dage rangdi, “Mipuigo, n kenlum dizu; nang luu neu kela nzwa peu n ziemne tei lulo.” Cipau bamdakkak siakdau pe napui yilu.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu mina cang mdai pokketei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Cipaucai Jisu heni cikade tetpwa Galilee Jaai ga taiga ga miedi. Pecai pa hangdeutu reuga hanglwe cika ntumlu. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Ge mina maadi ge peda gwang. Penui pepi kesiame, miakcietme, keswame, peletkegahme, nah keteeikeneime keda kekiee de ngngwa peda gwang. Penui pepi gage penuide kaibeu, nah pa penuide teingkeibeu. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />Iciu eh maadibe pelet kegahme marang kecu, keswame teingkei kelu, pepi kesiame tet kecu, nah miakcietme mangau kelu ngau luge penui macang sütdi. Nah penui Israel Tinggwang de twadi.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Pecai Jisu pa ledeukelumedung de qulu eh rangdi, “Ih maadibe de ngaupwa a lungsia dida, kedanemene penui langcumne acu ngngwa dida nah penui magede tyei kera bam meda. Ih penuide matyei mene lang gidi neu ma, mecai penui lampui gade temidi lubui.” <verse eid="MAT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Ge pa ledeukelume pe dage rangdi, “Mina lungh kemak ni aikade maadi aikiee ge tyei nggeilu kera anui dai gade taktyei ngaulu laino?” <verse eid="MAT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Jisu penui de keteu, “Nnui tangku dai kieege bam no?” Penui keligai, “Tangku kwak hena, nah heka keceunadung kecam nage.” <verse eid="MAT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Ge Jisu hemaabe de hangdeu ga ntum lulo beu. <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />Pa tangku kwak hena nah hekanadung de keulu, nah Tinggwang de hetwa peu kelucai, pa tangku kwadung de teipanglu eh cidungde pa ledeukelume de pwapeu. Ledeukelume cidungde pwa hemaabe de peu. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Penui pelane tyeilu nah nggeilu. Pecai penui taktyei tyei kebangbe hebie hena hekwa puilu. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Matyei kelume mipei cang mdai, mipui nah hename si mene. <verse eid="MAT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Pecai Jisu maadibe de lang gidi, eh liem ga nlütlu delwe tetpwa Magadan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:39 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Magadan: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Reketbam ge, Magdala zi msiak kedikelu.</char></note> cuikui ga miedi.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s">Marehi ge kekie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Phariseeme kangge nah Sadduceeme Jisu da gwang nah penuide tingkam gade marehi ge teilia gailo kie eh Jisu de kedei. <verse eid="MAT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Dede pa penuide keligai, [“Tinghegi gwang ge, nnui rangla, ‘Ting yizie da, kedanemene ting gie zeulu.’ <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />Tingcang dige, nnui rangla, ‘Ting yilak da, kedanemene ting gie nah remang zeulu.’ Nnui ting pie eh ting zu rangci la dede peting rehi dungde rangci gailak.] <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />Kesia nah nlumkemak ceheu marehi peeila, dede marehi gede peulak, Jonah marehi de gwale.” Ge Jisu penuide gidi eh tetdi.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Phariseeme nah Sadduceeme gu cehi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Ledeukelume rejaai kedale bie gwang keludau, penui tangku keupung kera nsung tadi. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Jisu penui dage rangdi, “Sünne lu nah Phariseemedung nah Sadduceeme gu cehi gade mriak lulo.” <verse eid="MAT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Penui katei penui kakgade mpau eh ranggai, “Anui tangku keugwang kemakne da.” <verse eid="MAT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Dede Jisu penui kerang de cilu eh rangdi, “Nnui kenlum kecammedung, daitei eh nnui kakgade nnui tangku bam kemakne lie reki lano? <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Nnui cude cilu mereu ni? Tangkukwak mengei le mina cang mengei pok teikelude, nah bangkelu hebie nnui hekwa kelude nsung meni? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Mede tangku hena le mina cang mdai pok teikelude nah bangkelu hebie kekiee ge nnui hekwa kelude? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Ih nnui dage tangku ha rang melie kecu nnui daitei cilu meno? Phariseeme penai Sadduceeme gu cehi gade mriak lulo.” <verse eid="MAT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Pecai penui pa penuide tangku cehi gade mriak kecube mene, Phariseeme penai Sadduceeme keledeu gade mriak lulo kerang de cilu.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Peter Jisu ha petkegai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Cu Jisu tetpwa Caesarea Philippi kemna cuikui ga gwang luge, pa ledeukelumedung de keteugai “Minadung Mina Nabe de caulie lano?” <verse eid="MAT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Ge penui rangdi, “Midungge Duipumketeibe John liela; kangge, Elijah; nah kedamedung, Jeremiah, mede caihakecime ge liela.” <verse eid="MAT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Pa penui dage rangdi, “Dede nnui a cule caulie lano?” <verse eid="MAT 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Ge Simon Peter keli eh rangdi, “Nang au Khrista, ringkela Tinggwang Nabe.” <verse eid="MAT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Jisu pe sam keligai, “Jonah napei Simon, nang samlam punglie, kedanemene pumteih nah mijai gade ncu aide peu ci luma, dede tinggim ga kebam a Pei ne ncu peu cigai. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />Nah Ih n dage rangla, nang au Peter,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Peter: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Greekme let gade tangtsu kang de petros lie la. Peter au langkegaimedung 12 reu kedibe.</char></note> nah aipau tsurareu gage Ih a ngqwaki teizie. Hades<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hades: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ketsaime deu</char></note> riekidung cide reu ngkieng dilak. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />Ih tinggim hegwangram cabidung de ncu peuzie. Nang kideu ga ma keheibe de ngkui kedibe tinggim gade ngkuidi zie, nah nang kideu ga ma keheibede ngkei kebeube tinggim gade ngkeibeu zie.” <verse eid="MAT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Pecai Jisu ledeukelume dage pa Khrista lie kecu midage de ranglia helo penuide aja kaigai.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu pe tsit mraikerang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Cipau ting gade Jisu pa ledeukelume dage pa Jerusalem ga hang delwe hangkiamedung, cingku kedime, nah laisiukecime ba gade keherei süt maikesia, nah mide peu pecu daptset nah langcumne benai ringcuh dai kera rang ladi. <verse eid="MAT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Peter pecu ngngwa ntsam mpetlwe pecu kesiu cuh eh ranggai, “Tinggwang peu ciciu lak Rampaubo; peu madaude aide nda aide teidi helo.” <verse eid="MAT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Dede Jisu nreugwang eh Peter dade rangdi, “A caile gwangdi, Satan! Nang au a lampui ga puikam ge, kedanemene nang Tinggwang zai gade mene mina zai gade cet kelane.” <verse eid="MAT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Cipaucai Jisu pa ledeukelume dage rangdi, “Mina keheibe de a caisui neucai, pekatei pecu mlaidi maisia, pe krus pwalu, delwe acai suilu. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Kedanemene keheibe de pe teilung kelilu neu kelabe cide tei nggah dizie, nah keheibe de a ziemne pe teilung tei nggah kedibe, cide ngau luzie. <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />Kedanemene mige kideu pelane pwa pegu teilu liede pe teilung tei nggah dicai daipai kemmi ge bamno? Mige pe teilung ngau dailu kerane daipai ge pwapeu lubui no? <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Kedanemene Mina Nabe pe tinggimgwame de ngngwalwe pe Pei kendu gade gwangzie. Pecai pa mina leune ziehi pe bata nsam rip gade teibeu zie. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />Ih nnui dage rangsiakte gaila, nnui kakga mina kangge Nabe pe hegwangram ga kegwang dwa ketsai msi kelakdung ge sap bam.”<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s">Tei ntsamkegai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Lang herokne cai Jisu Peter, James nah pe caihereibe John, penuide ne ngngwalwe lamlwatu kecehu ga hang penuikatei bamdi. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Penui dwade Jisu tsamceudi. Pe zu tingnaimiak nzwadi, nah pe niadung hapwa kebaa nzwadi. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Ainie, Moses penai Elijah pecu mpau kebam penuide pwalia. <verse eid="MAT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Ge Peter Jisu dage rangdi, “Rampaubo, anui aika ngngwa kebam daikenzwa gede yino! Magade nang nsui liecai, Ih paiki kecum aika ge tei beuzie, ket nziemne, ket Moses ziemne, nah ket Elijah ziemne.” <verse eid="MAT 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Pa marang kebamdau, ainie, hemwa kebaa ge gwang penuide sunglu, ge ainie, makwa ge hemwa gade ranggai, “Aide A Na akube da, Ih pecu asui keyibe da. Pe sam kingnei lulo.” <verse eid="MAT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Ledeukelume hangcum sam cide siu luge penui ngngi sütdi nah hangdeu ga keumie ngkumdi. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Ge Jisu gwang penuide deu eh ranggai, “Cuhlu, ngngi diso.” <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Cine penui ngangcuh piegai, dede Jisu gwale migede de ngau ma.<verse eid="MAT 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Penui lamlwa reu gade nghung keladau Jisu penuide aja kaigai, “Mina Nabe ketsai gade ringcuh dailu kemaktane mige dage de marengei kengau aide rang helo.” <verse eid="MAT 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Pa ledeukelumedung pecu keteugai, “Iciucai daitei eh laisiukecime Elijah gwangrai zielie rangla no?” <verse eid="MAT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Jisu keligai, “Elijah gwang kesang zie, nah maleune teihemi dai beuzie. <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />Dede Ih nnui dage rangla, Elijah ndaa gwang dida, dede penui pecu ci luma. Meliene, penui pecu pwa penui suibe tei dida. Cide nzwa eh penui Mina Nabe de de teikeherei zie.” <verse eid="MAT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Ge ledeukelume pa penui dage Duipumketeibe John ha rangzeu lie kecu cilu.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Herakesiabe ne ngngwa kela nage de teikengkei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Penui maadibe da gwang luge, mige peda gwang eh pe dwaga koktungmie, <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />nah rangdi, “Rampaubo, a na de ngaunggia gailo, kedanemene pa au hekim kecume ge nah keherei sütla dida. Pa mi gage nah dui gage kaugai bamla. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Ih pecu ngngwa nang ledeukelume da gwang, dede penui pecu teimmi gailakdi.” <verse eid="MAT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Ge Jisu keligai, “Nlumkemak nah petau kemak ceheudung, Ih daitie ge nnuide ngngwa bam laino? Ih daitie ge nnuide liabam maisia reuno? Pecu aika ada ngngwa gwanglo.” <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Jisu herakesiabe de kesiu gai, ge cide pe dade mpetdi, nah henanabe de cipau ting siakdau yilu.<verse eid="MAT 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Pecai ledeukelume ngkim Jisu da gwang rangdi, “Daitei anui herakesiabe de gwa mpet gailak dino?” <verse eid="MAT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />Ge Jisu penui dage rangdi, “Nnui kenlum keceune. Ih nnui dage rangsiakte gaila, nnui kenlum ziegitsi hia nage bamcai, nnui lamlwa aide de, ‘Aika de lule mpet dilo,’ degai de cide mpet dizie, nah magede nnui teigai kelak bamlak.” <verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kehegwa laisiu kesa pedum 21 de sila. </char></note> [Dede herakesia aikenzwa au kekie nah kemmwang rünne gade gwa mpet lula.]<verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Penui Galilee deuceu ga kebamdau, Jisu pa ledeukelume dage rangdi, “Mina Nabe de nimpwa miba gage kaidi lai zeuda, <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />nah penui pecu teitset dizie, dede langcumne benai pecu teu cuh dai luzie.” Ledeukelumedung penui lungsia sütdi.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kerecaki ceha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Jisu nah pa ledeukelume Capernaum nam ga gwang luge, drachma-kena<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Drachma-kena: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kerecaki ceha, shekel pempie ge. Tet. 30:13.</char></note> ceha ha kelame gwang Peter dage rangdi, “Nnui keledeube drachma-kena ceha de peula ni?” <verse eid="MAT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Peter keligai, “Yeo.” Peter kilung ga nlüt luge, Jisu peda marang raigai, “Simon, n lungning daino? Cau dade kideu ga hegwangme herahadung hala no? Pe minadung dade mi kedamedung dade no?” <verse eid="MAT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Pa, “Kedamedung dade,” de rang kegai dau, Jisu pe dage rangdi, “Iciucai deuketme dade au ha mede yida” <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />Dede anui heraha kehame lung tei msiadi melu kerane, rejaai ga miecu, delwe kagwak kelien gailu, nah heka nghang raitube keulo. Nang pe mui nkeigai de, nang shekel ge ngau luzie. Cide keulu delwe anai gu ceha penuide peulu.”<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s">Tinggim hegwangram ga ditube</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Cipau tingdau ledeukelume Jisu da gwang eh ranggai “Caune tinggim hegwangram gade ditu zieno?” <verse eid="MAT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Ge Jisu hename gede pe da quteu gwanglwe penui kakga ge pecu kailu, <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />nah rangdi, “Ih nnui dage rangsiakte gaila, nnui lung nreulwe hename nzwalu kemaktane, nnui madaude tinggim hegwangram ga nlüt gailak. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Ciziemne, keheibe de pekatei pecu tei henahpwa hena aipau nade nzwa kelube ne tinggim hegwangram gade ditu zie. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />Keheibe de hena aikenzwa nade a zi gade ngngwa kelame, acu de ngngwa lula. <verse eid="MAT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />Dede keheibe de hename acu nlum kelame aidungde hangge de de peu kemau teidi cai, pe ngwang gage keniaktsu kedi keulwe peu jaaidi kecuk gage pecu kegaktset kedibe pe ziemne yiki lie.<verse eid="MAT 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />Ainie mide peu kemau teikelane kideube ziemne! Kemauketei cidungde gwang maisia, dede kemauketei cidungde teugwang kegaime ainie! <verse eid="MAT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />N ba mede n pi ne ncu peu kemau teidi lacai, cide dangdi delwe keliengi dilu. N ba mede n pi kena punglwe kelungta mijaai gage keliengai kedi swa au rejam eh mede swa eh kering ga nlüt kelube n ziemne yiki. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />N miak ncu peu kemau teidi lacai, cide letlwe kelien gidi lu. N miak miakna pung eh mijaai gage keliengai kedi swa au miakli eh kering ga nlüt kelube n ziemne yiki.<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gahkedi meurün samgwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />Nnui keceu aidungde hangge de de mneu melu kerane mriak lulo. Kedanemene Ih nnui dage rang gaila, tinggim ga penui tinggimgwame tinggim ga kebam a Pei dwaga bam muila kecune. <verse eid="MAT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kehegwa laisiu kesa ga pedum 11 de sila. </char></note> [Mina Nabe gah kedime de kelilu zielie gwang kecune.] <verse eid="MAT 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />Nnui dai cetno? Magade mige pe meurün haige bam eh, ket gah dicai, pa riakhekuiehekui de kideutu reudung gade gidi eh mie gah kedina de peeila meni? <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Magade pa cide peei lucai, Ih nnui dage rangsiakte gaila, gahdi kemak riakhekuiehekui swade pa gah kedi nade peei kelude ziemne pe suiyi kizie. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Cide nzwa eh, tinggim kebam nnui Pei de keceu aidungde hangge de peu kapdi kera pesui ma.<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">N dage kemau teikegai sinabe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />Magade n sinabe n dage kemau teigai cai, mie delwe nnaikatei kebam dau pe mau ranglia lo. Pa n sam kingnei lucai, nang n sinabe de ngaudai luda. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Dede pa n sam kingnei gailak dicai, kedame hangge mede hangnade ncu silu, ciciu eh hangna mede hangcum mui zierang gade sam leune kesanglie lu kerane. <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Nah pa penui sam kingnei rau dicai, ma cide ngqwa dage ranglo. Pa ngqwabe sam kingnei rau dicai, peu pecu Jewme kemakme nah heraha kehame nzwala dilo. <verse eid="MAT 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />Ih nnui dage rangsiakte gaila, nnui kideu gade ma keheibe ngkui kedibe tinggim gade ngkui dizie; nah nnui kideu gade ma keheibe ngkei kebeube tinggim gade ngkei beuzie. <verse eid="MAT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />Ih nnui dage rangsiakte dai gaila, nnui kideu ga hangna ma keheibe de penui kelungzwa eh kiecai, tinggim ga kebam a Pei cidungde tei beuzie. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />A zi gade hangna mede hangcum ngngwa ngkwa kebam ga, Ih de cipaume kakga bamzie.”<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Cipaucai Peter Jisu da gwang delwe rangdi, “Rampaubo, a sinabe a dage pia daikiee ge kemau tei eh Ih pe mau gibeu maisia no? Pia hena zieni?” <verse eid="MAT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Ge Jisu pe dage rangdi, “Ih n dade pia hena de rang ma, dede pia riakhena kecu hena kieege lo. <verse eid="MAT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />Ciziemne, tinggim hegwangram au hegwangme ge pe kilamedung de pe bata riep ranggai lo de kecu nzwa da. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Pa cide tei ndeu cuh kecudau, kila hangge pe pau rangkang talent cang kerei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Talent cang kerei: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">heta tei kelame mmi kereimengei kenzwage ziehi kieege. </char></note> pung kela gede pe da ngngwa gwang. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Dede pe pau kap gailak kedine, pe mpaube pecu, pe nau, pe name, nah pegu maleune zwalu delwe pe pau kapdai beu lulo aja kaigai. <verse eid="MAT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />Cine kilapei koktung mie pe dwaga keumie eh ranggai, ‘A mpaubo, acu kwagai rielo, Ih n pau leune kap daibeu zielie.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Cine kila mpaube, pecu ngaunggia eh pecu püt peu nah pepau nggah beudi. <verse eid="MAT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />Dede kila cipaude mpetlwe pe kilame keda hangge pe pau denarii haige<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:28 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Denarii haige: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">denarius ge cai luh ta keteime tingnaige mahi zie pwa peu kela. Denarii haige cai heta keteime zie keicum mede zie haige mahi kecu zie. </char></note> pung kela gede ngaulu. Pa pecu heraklu delwe pecu kekiplu eh ranggai, ‘Nang apau pung kelade kap lulo.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />Ge kilapei, pe zangbe de keukeimie penggia kie eh ranggai, ‘Acu kwagai rielo, Ih n pau kap daibeu zielie.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />Dede kila keraibe de cide tei neu tadi. Meliene, pa mie delwe pecu hebaangki gage kelien gaidi, pau kaplu kemaktane. <verse eid="MAT 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />Ciziemne pe zangme, kila kedamedung cide ngau luge, penui lung sia sütdi. Nah penui gwang delwe penui mpaube dage cipau ha de pelane paubeu. <verse eid="MAT 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />Ge pe mpaupei pecu qulu, delwe pe dage rangdi, ‘Nang kila kesiabo, nang a pau pung kela pelane Ih gikap beu dida, nang a dade n nggia kekiene. <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />Ih ncu ngaunggia kebeu nzwa, nang de kila n zangme de ngaunggia gailak ni?’ <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />Pe mpaupei pe rata eh pepau pelane kaplu kemaktane pecu tei keherei kerame ba gage kaibeudi. <verse eid="MAT 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />Cine tinggim kebam a Pei de aide nzwa nnui dage teigai zie, nnui nnuilung gade nnui siname maudung gibeu mecai.”<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s">Lakcak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Jisu sam aidungde rangcang dige, pa Galilee gade tetdi, delwe Jordan Reuki lulegim Judea cuikui ga gwangdi. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Mina maadi ge pecai sui gwang, nah pa penuide cikade teingkeibeu.<verse eid="MAT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Phariseeme kangge pe da gwang pecu kedei eh ranggai, “Mige pekie keheibe ziemne pe naude ta kedi petau ni?” <verse eid="MAT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Jisu keligai, “Raitu gade penaide Damkegaibe mipei penai mipui de damkegai nnui kesanglaisiu gade pei meni? <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />Pa rang si eh, ‘Aipau kie de ziemne mige pe pui nah pe pei de gidi eh pe nau de ngngwa ket tei dizie, nah penai ngngwa teih ge dizie.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kendeu 2:24.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Cine penai hangna tadi zie, dede teih ge dizie. Ciziemne Tinggwang ne teincüt kebeude, peu mina de teu ntsamdi helo.” <verse eid="MAT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />Phariseeme Jisu de keteugai, “Ciciu cai daitei Moses migede nauta laisiu pwapeu delwe pe nau de langgi lulo aja kai beuno?” <verse eid="MAT 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Jisu keligai, “Moses au nnui lung takzu kecune nnui naumedung de nnui talu builie beu, dede ndaa raitu gade cide aiciu ma. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Ih nnui dage rang gaila, keheibe de kemmha kecu ziemne mene pe naude ta cai, delwe keda gede luu daicai, kemmha ta tei dida; nah mipei takedi pui gede luu cai, pa kemmha ta tei dida.” <verse eid="MAT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Pa ledeukelume Jisu dage rangdi, “Mige pe nau dade aiciu cai, pe nau tei kemakbe yiki lie.” <verse eid="MAT 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Dede Jisu penui dage rangdi, “Keledeu aide mileune luulu gailak, dede Tinggwang ne ngha kecume gwale. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Kedanemene kangge au kelak teigai kelak pe pui neki gade cinzwa mnalu, nah kangge au mina suine, nah kangge au tinggim hegwangram ziemne kelak tei kelak penuikatei de tiaklu. Keheibe de keledeu aide luulo kebuime de peu luu lulo.”<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Henamedung nah Jisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Cidau mina kangge henamedung de ngngwa peda gwang iciu eh pe ba hwa pwa penui reu gage kai delwe kekie teibeulu kerane, dede ledeukelume penuide kesiudi. <verse eid="MAT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Dede Jisu rangdi, “Henamedung de peu ada gwanglo, penuide kaam helo, kedanemene tinggim hegwangram au cipaume gulu.” <verse eid="MAT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Pa pe ba hwapwa henamedung reu gage kaigai, delwe samlam beu eh cikade pa tetdi.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makeheibe nah Tinggwang hegwangram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Ainie, mige Jisu da gwang eh keteugai, “Keledeubo, Ih kelungta kering ngaulu kerane bata keyi daipai tei maisia no?” <verse eid="MAT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Jisu pe dage rangdi, “Daitei nang a dade makeyibe ha keteu lano? Keyibe au ket rünne, dede nang kelungta kering ngaulu neucai, hezaidung kai kebeu de mzai lulo.” <verse eid="MAT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Minabe pe dage rangdi, “Daipau zaidung deno?” Jisu rangdi, “Mide daptset so, mmha so, rega so, kenret zierang teiso, <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />n pui n pei de rütlu, nah n kidacaina de hungpwa nkatei ncu kehung nzwa lu.” <verse eid="MAT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Rehangbe pe dage rangdi, “Ih ma aidungde pelane mzai lada. Ih daipai tei silu maisia reu no?” <verse eid="MAT 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Jisu pe dage rangdi, “Nang magade yicangsiak neucai, mie delwe n mabam pelane zwadi, delwe kegahme de peudi, iciude nang tinggim ga mabam bam luzie, delwe gwang acai suilu.” <verse eid="MAT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Dede rehangbe Jisu kerang de siu luge, pa pe suisia eh tetdi, kedanemene pa mabam kekiee ge bam kecune.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Jisu pa ledeukelume dage ranggai, “Ih nnui dage rangsiakte gaila, kehei mege ziemne tinggim hegwangram ga nlüt pa zie. <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Ih nnui dage ranggai daila, keheime ge Tinggwang hegwangram ga nlüt kera swade ut ge de peu langhim miki gade liampet kecube laki lie.” <verse eid="MAT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Ledeukelume cide siu luge, penui macang süt eh keteugai, “Iciu cai caube de kelilu zieno?” <verse eid="MAT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Dede Jisu penui de piegai eh penui dage rangdi, “Mina ne aide tei gailak, dede Tinggwang au maleune teilu bui.” <verse eid="MAT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Ge Peter keligai eh pe dage rangdi, “Pielo, anui au maleune gikap di eh ncai suila dida. Ciciu cai anui ziemne daipai bam lai?” <verse eid="MAT 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Jisu penui dage rangdi, “Ih nnui dage rangsiakte gaila, kideu keheci ga Mina Nabe pe hegwangbam kendu ga bam keludau, nnui a caisui kelume, nnuide hegwangbamdung kereiekena ga bam eh Israel leuhme kereiekena tutiak teizie. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Keheibe de a zi ziemne pe kidung, pe sinapeime, pe time, pe pui, pe pei, pe nau mede hangdeu de gikedime hai kiee ge ngau luzie, nah kelungta kering ngaulu zie. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Dede mi kekiee ge rai kelame kam dizie, nah kam kelame rai dizie.”<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s">Kubeluh ga hetaketeime samgwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />“Kedanemene tinggim hegwangram au hangdeu mpaube pe gu kubeluh ziemne heta keteime zie likera tingcang nuge kemie nzwa delie. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />Pecai pa heta tei kerame de ngngwa langnai ge ziehi dinarius<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Dinarius: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rangkanggeu ge, heta keteime de peu kela langnaige ziehi.</char></note> ge peu kera kesuizwa luge, pa penuide pe gu kubeluh gage langgaidi. <verse eid="MAT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />Pa tingcang bam hekui dauge tetpet dai nah heta keteime kedame litakni ga mata tei mene sap kebam ngaulu. <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />Pa penui dage rangdi, ‘Nnui de, kubeluh ga miecu, nah Ih nnuide petaube peu zie.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Cine penui miedi. Pa tingna tingding nah tinghegi bam cum daude mie cinzwa tei. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Tinghegi bam mengei dau pa tetpet daige, kedamedung ge matei mene sapbam eh ngaulu. Pa penuide keteugai, ‘Daitei eh nnui tingba zie pelane matei mene aika sap bam no?’ <verse eid="MAT 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />Penui pe dage rangdi, ‘Kedanemene migede anuide zie likera gah kecune lie.’ Ge pa penui dage ranggai, ‘Nnui de kubeluh ga miecu.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />Tinghegi miege, kubeluh mpaube pe gu kerengeibe dage rangdi, ‘Matei kelamedung de qulu delwe penui ziedung penuide peubeulo, kamtube gade ndeu eh raitube kecangde.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />Bam mengei daune liteu kelamedung de gwangge, penui hangge kecu de denarius ge ngau kaplu. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Heta ketei keraimedung gwangge, penui ciswa ngau kieelu zie ha de eh penui cet, dede penui de denarius ge gwale ngau silu ma. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Penui penui zie ngau luge, penui hangdeu mpaube de ncamdi. <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />Penui rangdi, ‘Heta ketei kamtu aipaudung de au bamdakkak ket gwale mata teima, anui au tinglum lia eh mringbeting matei sapmui, dede nang penui zie anuide kepeu kieege peu.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />Dede pe mpaube penui hangge pau de keligai, ‘Azangmedung, Ih nnuide magede teimau ma. Nnui acu ngngwa denarius ket gage samdaulu de meni? <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Nnui zie keulu delwe tet dilu. Ih heta ketei kamtu aidungde de nnuide kepeu nsam ge peu kera Ih asui lie. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Ih akatei agu lepwane Ih asuibe tei kera a njeu meni? Mi Ih a zai keyine acu nnui riak lano?’ <verse eid="MAT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />Cine keraime kam dizie, nah kekamme rai luzie.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kehegwa laisu yitubedung ga</char><char style="fqa">qu kelume au kieesüt, dede kedetkelume au kecam nage </char> de kecude bam lama. </note><verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu pe tsit ha mraikerang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Jisu Jerusalem ga hangla ge, pa ledeukelume kereiekena de ngngwa ntsamlu eh, lampuiki de pa penui dage rangdi, <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />“Ainie, anui Jerusalem ga hang zeuda, nah Mina Nabe de nimpwa cingku kedime nah laisiukecime ba gage kaidi zie. Delwe penui pecu mmau eh peu tsai dilo zie, <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />nah penui pecu henui tei, dap nah gwak dilo eh Gentileme de balie beu dizie. Dede lang cumne benai pa ringdai cuh luzie.”<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mipui ge kekie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Pecai Zebedee nau pena kenade nzang eh Jisu da gwang. Pa pe dwa keumie pe dade mage kie. <verse eid="MAT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Jisu pe dade rangdi, “Nang daipai luneu lano?” Pa pe dage rang eh, “N hegwangram ga a na aikena de peu hangge n ba zetle nah hangge hile peu bam kera samkai beulo.” <verse eid="MAT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Dede Jisu keli eh ranggai, “Nnai dai kie labi nnai pekie ci eh kiela ma. Nnai Ih sak zielie kebam hepiak de gade sak lubui ni?” Penai pe dage rangdi, “Anai sak lubui.” <verse eid="MAT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Pa penui dage ranggai, “Nnai a piak sak zie. Dede a ba zetle nah a ba hile bam kera Ih peu kera a mjeu ma, dede cide au tinggim kebam a Pei ne riemteu kelame ziemne zie.” <verse eid="MAT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Ge ledeukelume keda kereibau aide siu luge, cipau sina kena de penui rata sütdi. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Dede Jisu penuide quteu peda gwanglu eh rangdi, “Gentileme kedime ne penui peureu hegwang teikela, nah kemlang minadung ne penui peureu kengkieng teukela nnui cibam. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Dede nnui kakga au aide nzwadi kerabe ma. Meliene, keheibe de nnui kakga di keneube de peu nnui kila tei maisia, <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />nah keheibe de nnui kakga de raineu kelabe de peu nnui kila tei maisia, <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />Mina Nabe de mide peu pe gwatei zielie gwang ma, dede mi gwatei kera, nah mina kekiee de rilu kerane pe teilung kaibeu zielie gwang.”<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Miaktcitme kena mangaukelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Penui Jericho<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Jericho: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">namdi aide Jordan Reuki Naimiak kenlütle Kung taiga bam.</char></note> namdi gade tetdi zeuge, mina maadi ge pe caisui gwang. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Ainie, miakcitme hangna lampui kungga ntumbam. Penai Jisu cilambie gwang kela siu luge, penai sahbakgai, “Rampaubo, David Napei, anaide ngaunggia gailo.” <verse eid="MAT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Dede hemaabe penaide mlei helo kesiudi, dede penai sah mtei ki eh ranggai, “Rampaubo, David Napei, anaide ngaunggia gailo.” <verse eid="MAT 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Ge Jisu saplu eh penaide qugai eh rangdi, “Acu peu nnai dage daipai teigai neu lano?” <verse eid="MAT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />Ge penai pe dage rangdi, “Rampaubo, anai miak teimrak beulo.” <verse eid="MAT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Cine Jisu penaide ngaunggia eh penai miak deugai. Ge zette penai ma ngaulu delwe pe caisui ladi.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s">Hecili eh kelüt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Jisu nah pa ledeukelume Jerusalem tai gwang nna eh Olive deutu, Bethphage nam ga gwang luge, Jisu ledeukelume hangna de langgai eh, <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />penai dage ranggai, “nnai dwaga kebam renam ga miecu, iciude cika gada gede, nah pe nade si eh keu pwabam eh ngau zette luzie. Penaide hiaklwe ada ngngwa gwanglu. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Mi keheibe cide ziemne nnai dage magede keteu cai, nnai, ‘Rampaube ai kena de teu maisia zeulie,’ de eh rang beulu, nah ciciu de nnai cipau de nnui zette langgai beuzie.” <verse eid="MAT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Cu aide ndaa caihakecibe rang kenzeu de peu tei canglu kerane. Pa ranggai,<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />“Zion napui<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Zion napui: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jerusalem ga minadung.</char></note> dage rang beulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">‘ainie, n Hegwangpei nda gwang lalie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">henah eh gada ge reu cwalwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">gadana ge reu ga, gada ge na reu ga.’”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zec. 9:9</char></note><verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Ge ledeukelube kena de mie delwe Jisu rang kebeu nzwa penai teilu. <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />Penai gada nah pena de ngngwa gwanglu delwe penui paidung gada reu gage kailu eh Jisu cipau reu ga bamlu. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Mina kekiee ge penui paidung lampui gage kamgai, nah kedame tsingbangdung gade tsingkiadung bilu delwe pwa cidungde lampui gage kamlu. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Cidau Jisu dwaga kela maadi de nah pe caisui kelame sahbak eh ranggai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:9">“Hosanna David napei!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:9">Rampaube zi teukegwangbe samlam pungtu lie!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:9">Hutube Hosanna!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 118:26</char></note><verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Jisu Jerusalem ga lüt luge, namdi pelane popbak eh rangdi, “Aide cau no?” <verse eid="MAT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Ge hemaabe keligai, “Aipaude au caihakecibe Jisu, Galilee deu Nazareth gade gwang.”<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu kerecaki ga kelüt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Pecai Jisu kerecaki ga lüt. Pa kerecaki ga malui nah zwa kebam pelane de gwa mpetdi, delwe rangkang hiak kebamme kekaibamdung de nah ruipuinedung zwa kebam bamdung de kwak ngkumdi. <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />Pa penui dage rangdi, “Kesanglaisiu ga ainzwa rau nzeu, ‘A ki le pwane kekieki lie quzie,’ dede nnui cide le pwa keregamedung mbaiki tei dida.” <verse eid="MAT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Ge miakcitme nah pisiame kerecaki ga pe da gwang, nah Jisu penuide teingkeibeu. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Dede cingku kedimedung nah laisiukecimedung, pa mimakecang batadung tei kegai ngau, nah henamedung kerecaki gade, “Hosanna David Napei,” de sah kebam siu luge penui rata sütdi. <verse eid="MAT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />Penui pecu keteu, “Penui rang kebam de nang siu bam ha?” Jisu penui dage rangdi, “Yeo! Dede nnui madaude Kesanglaisiu gade pei meni, ‘Henamedung nah ngiena tung kebamdung mui gade ketwa peu kera nang mtei luda’?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 8:3</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Pecai pa penuide pütdi delwe namdi be gade tetpwa Bethany ga gwangdi nah cika tingmuizui zeudi.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tangzüttsi bang reguikedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Pecai benai tingcang pa namdi ga cailigwang daila ge, pa mzeudi. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Lampui kungga tangzüttsi bang ket kebam ngau eh, pa cide da mie, dede penei gwale magede ngau luma. Cide da pa rangdi, “Peu madaude n dade matsi buidai helo,” ge zette tangzüttsi bang de regui miedi. <verse eid="MAT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Ge ledeukelumedung cide ngau pwa penui macangdi eh, penui kakgade rangdi, “Dainzwa tangzüttsi bang de regui zette dino?” <verse eid="MAT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Jisu penui sam keligai, “Ih nnui dage rangsiakte gaila, nnui kenlum bam eh nnui suihau mecai, nnui tangzüttsi bang aide dage tei kegai rünne tei lak, dede nnui lamlwatu aide de, ‘Cuhlu delwe jaaidi ga cak lüt dilo,’ degai cai cide ciciu luzie. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Makeheibe de nnui nlumsiak eh, kie cai, nnui ngau luzie.”<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu kengkieng keteukedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Pa kerecaki ga lütlwe mide ledeu bam ge, cingku kedimedung nah hangkiamedung peda gwang eh ranggai, “Daipai kengkieng teu nang aidungde teibam no, nah caune ncu kengkieng aide peu no?” <verse eid="MAT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Ge Jisu penui samkeligai, “Ih de nnuide mage keteu zie. Nnui acu cide kelibeu cai, Ih dai kengkieng teu Ih ma aidungde tei labi ranglia zie. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />John mide duipum ketei de, dai gade gwang no? Tinggim gade mi mina dade no?” Ge penuikatei penui kakga de mpau bamdi, “Magade anui, ‘Tinggim gade,’ de rang cai, pa anuide, ‘Iciucai nnui daitei pecu nlum meno?’ de rangzie. <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Dede anui, ‘Mina dade de rangcai,’ anui maadidung de hing, kedanemene penui pelane John au caihakecime gelie kelane.” <verse eid="MAT 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Cine penui Jisu samkeligai, “Anui cima.” Pa de penui dage rangdi, “Ih de dai kengkieng teu eh aidungde tei labi kecu nnuide ranglia lak.<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sina kena samgwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />Dede nnui dainzwa cetla no? Mige pena hangna bam. Pa hecingbe da mie delwe ranggai, ‘Ana, henai kubeluh ga mie heta teilo.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Ge pe na keligai, ‘Ih mielak,’ dede pecaine pa pelung nreulu delwe miedi. <verse eid="MAT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Pecai pe pei pe na henabe da mie delwe ci kesiakte rangdai. Pa keligai, ‘Ih miezie, kedibo,’ dede pa mie tadi. <verse eid="MAT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />Cipau kenade caube pe pei suiyi teino?” Penui rangdi, “Keraibe.” Jisu penui dage rangdi, “Ih nnui dage rangsiakte gaila, heraha kehame nah helipuidung Tinggwang hegwangram ga nnui dwarai nlüt zie. <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Kedanemene John makesang lampui gade nnui da gwang, dede nnui pecu nlum luma. Dede heraha kehame nah helipuidung pecu nlumlu. Dede nnui, aide nnui ngau kelu caide, nnui helungnreu delwe pecu nlum luma.<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hetaketeime samgwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />Samgwa keda kingnei lulo. Ndaa mige, hangdeu mpaume ge bamla. Pa kubeluh ge talu, delwe perie rie twagwalu, cikage zauniakbam ge kuilu, reketbam ge teilu, delwe kubeluh keteime dage ngnget peudi. Pecai pa renam keda lebie miedi. <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />Kubetsi railu kera ting gwang ge, pa pe kilamedung kangge de kubeluh ketame dage pe qwa kubetsi pwalu kerane langgai. <verse eid="MAT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />Dede kubeluh ketame pe kilame de nimlu, hangge de dap, hangge de teitsetdi, delwe keda gede tangtsu le pwa sam. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Pe mpaube keraibe pia swade kiee eh kilame keda de langdai gai, dede kubeluh ketame keraime de kesiakge penui dage de teigai. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />Cipau cai, pe mpaube pena de penui dage langgai, ‘Penui a na de au rüt zie’ de rang eh. <verse eid="MAT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />Dede kubeluh ketamedung pena de ngau luge, penuikatei kempau eh rangdi, ‘Aide pe mapwabe da. Gwanglu, anui pecu teitsetdi delwe anui pe mabam luu lugo.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Cine penui pecu nimlu eh kubeluh gwale ge pecu kelien mpetti, delwe pecu teitsetdi. <verse eid="MAT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />Cu kubeluh mpaube gwang de, kubeluh ketamedung de pa daipai tei zieno?” <verse eid="MAT 21:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />Penui pe dage rangdi, “Mina kesia cidungde de peu keherei süt eh tsai dizie, delwe kubeluh ketame kedame de ngnget peu dizie, petsi kerai tingdau pecu pe qwa pwapeu lu kerame de.” <verse eid="MAT 21:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Jisu penui dage rangdi, “Kesanglaisiudung gade nnui madaude pei meni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">‘Ki keteime tangtsu gi kedide,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">aide kimiaktsu tei dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">Aide Rampaube dade gwang,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">nah cide ngau mima kecangh gelie’? <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 118:22-23</char></note><verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />Cine Ih nnui dage rang gaila, Tinggwang hegwangram nnui dade keuteu dizie nah heleuh petsi builu kela gede de peu dizie. <verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Keheibe de tangtsu aide reu ga cak kemieme de tei pang kecai dizie. Dede keheibe reuga cide cak miecai, cide pecu tei kecai dizie.” <verse eid="MAT 21:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Cingku kedimedung nah Phariseemedung pe samgwadung de siu luge, pa penui ha rangzeu lie kecu penui cilu. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Penui pecu tuilu kera peei, dede maadibe de penui hingdi, kedanemene minadung pecu le pwane caihakecime gelie la kedine.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s">Laktak ngyi samgwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Jisu penui dage samgwa gade marang daigai, <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />“Tinggim hegwangram au hegwangpei ge pe napei ziemne laktak ngyi ge mteikelu nzwa delie. <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Pa laktak ngyi ga gwang lulo de qu kenzeume de qu kerane pe kilame de langgai, dede penui gwang raudi. <verse eid="MAT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />Hegwangpei pe kila kedadung de langgai dai eh ranggai, ‘Qu kenzeume de rang lo, “Ainie, Ih taktyei mtei luda. A tumseudung nah hetumna pelui keyibe gi pwa bam dida, nah ma pelane mtei pwa bam dida. Laktak ngyi ga gwang lulo.’” <verse eid="MAT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />Dede penui cide malie tadi eh tetdi, hangge pe luh ga miedi, keda ge pe litak lebie miedi. <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />Kedame hegwangpei kilamedung de tuilu eh penuide teu hengngam tei, delwe penuide teitsetdi. <verse eid="MAT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />Hegwangpei pe ratadi, nah pa pe reugwame de langgai eh mide dapketsetmedung de teitsetdi nah penui namdi rudi. <verse eid="MAT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />Pecai pa pe kilamedung dage rangdi, ‘Laktak ngyi mtei luda, dede qu kenzeumedung au gwang dui dida. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Ciziemne nnui puihaidung kekah ga mie delwe mina ngau kelu leune de laktak ngyi gage qu gailu.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Kilame cidungde puidikidung ga mie delwe mina keyi kesia leune de qu hekwa teu gwanglu. Cine laktak kibung ga pe giame ne puilu. <verse eid="MAT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />Dede hegwangpei pe giame de pie zie lie nlüt luge, cika mige laktak paini teu mene kebam pa ngaulu. <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />Ge hegwangpei pa dage rangdi, ‘Azangbo, nang laktak paini <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Laktak paini: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipau tingdau, hegwangpei mede laktak ngyi mpaube pe giame de laktak paini peula, iciu eh laktak ngyi ga petau tei eh gwanglu kerane.</char></note>teu mene dai nzwa aika lütlu dino?’ Dede minabe marang gailak di. <verse eid="MAT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />Pecai hegwangpei kilamedung dage rangdi, ‘Mina aipaude pi nah pe ba kanglu, delwe pecu hegwale kemui gage kelien gai dilu, cikade hap nah geigim pung bam dizie.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />“Kedanemene qu kelu au mina kieesüt, dede kedetkelume au kecam nage.”<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Caesar de Heraha kepeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Pecai Phariseemedung mie delwe dai nzwa penui pecu pe samdung gade pecu tuilu ziebi kecu riem ladi. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Cipaucai penui caisuimedung nah Herodiame de penui pe dage langgai. Penui rangdi, “Keledeubo, nang samsang kecu anui ci, nah nang kesangsiak gade Tinggwang zai mide ledeu la. Mikeheibe de daipai cet zie bi kecu nang lungpang lama, kedanemene nang mina sap de de piela kemakne. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Cine nlung cet anui dage ranglia lo? Caesar <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Caesar: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Romeme deuceudibe</char></note>de heraha habeu kera hezai mi meno?” <verse eid="MAT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Dede Jisu penui ciem kesiadung cilu eh rangdi, “Daitei nnui acu kedei lano, nnui hezaiteikelamedung? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Heraha hakela rangkanggeu acu keulia lo.” Cidau penui pe dage denarius ge<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Denarius ge: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">rangkanggeu ge</char></note> teugwang beu. <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />Jisu penui de keteu, “Aide caube mie nah caube zi no?” <verse eid="MAT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Penui pe da, “Caesar,” de rangdi. Ge Jisu penui dage rangdi, “Iciucai Caesar gu Caesar de peu dilu nah Tinggwang gu Tinggwang de peu dilu.” <verse eid="MAT 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Penui cide siu luge, penui macangdi. Pecai penui pecu pütdi eh tetdi.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ringcuhkelu gade laktak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Cipaunai Sadduceemedung kangge, ringcuhdai kelu gahlie rangkelame, pe da gwang. Penui pecu keteugai, <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />“Keledeubo, Moses, ‘Mige pe name lungh mene tsaidi cai, pe sinabe de peu pe nau de luulu delwe pe sinabe name lunghlu maisia,’ debeu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hez. 25:5-6</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Cu anui kakga sinamedung hang hena bamla. Cingtube pe nau teilu ge pena lungh mene tsaidi. Nah pa pe caihereibe de pe naude gidiak. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Ge pe sina pekenabe de cinzwa teidi, pecai pekecumbe de cinzwa jüja pehenabe kecang. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Penui pelane tsai kedi cai, mipuibe de tsaidi. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Cu ringcuhdai kecu benai, cipau puide sinamedung hang hena gade caube nau zie no? Kedanemene penui pelane de pecu luulu de kecune.” <verse eid="MAT 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Dede Jisu penuide keligai, “Nnui cet maula dida, kedanemene nnui Kesanglaisiu mede Tinggwang kengkieng de ci kemakne. <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Kedanemene ringcuhdai kecu benai laktak tei mede hemeu meu lak. Meliene, penui au tinggim ga tinggimgwame nzwa dizie. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Dede nnui ketsaime ringcuhdai kecu ha, Tinggwang ne nnui dage kerang de Kesanglaisiu gade pei meni, <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />‘Ih au Abraham Tinggwang, Isaac Tinggwang nah Jacob Tinggwang’? Tinggwang au ketsaime Tinggwang ma, dede keringme gu lie.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tet. 3:6</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Maadibe aide siu luge, pe keledeu samdung ziemne penui macangdi.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samkaikebeu ditube</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Dede Phariseemedung Jisu Sadduceeme sam deu nggah kedi siu luge, penui gwang ngkwalu. <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />Penui kakga hezaikecime ge hangge, pecu kedei eh mage keteu, <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />“Keledeubo, hezai kaikebeu gade dai dele ditu no?” <verse eid="MAT 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />Jisu pe sam keligai, “‘Rampaube n Tinggwang de n nlung pelane, n keringria pelane nah n lungcet pelane teu hung lulo.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hez. 6:5.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Aide hezai kaikebeu raitu nah ditube da. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Nah hezai kaikebeu pekenabe cai, ‘Nkatei ncu keku nzwa n kidacaina de ku lulo,’ de kecu deda. <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Caihakecime samdung nah hezai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:40 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Caihakecime samdung nah hezai: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Samkak kehegwabe pelane de rangbam da.</char></note> pelane aipau kena ga ngngei pwabam.”<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khrista caube na no?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Phariseemedung gwang ngkwa kebam dau, Jisu penui dage mage keteu. <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />Pa keteugai, “Nnui Khrista ha daipai ge cet lano? Pa cau napei no?” Penui keligai, “David napei.” <verse eid="MAT 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Ge Jisu penui dage rangdi, “Iciu cai dainzwa David Tinggwang Rabe gade pecu Rampaubo de qu eh,<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />‘Rampaube a Rampaube dage rangdi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">“A ba zetle bamlu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">Ih n ngauraume de pwa n pidau teidi kemakta,”’ de eh rang no?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 110:1</char></note><verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />David Khrista de ‘Rampaubo,’ de qu cai dainzwa pa David na lu laino?” <verse eid="MAT 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Migede sam tie ge de teu pe sam kelilu tadi, nah cipaunai gade, migede pe dade ma keteu hingdi.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s">Rangmriak kegai sam hena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Pecai Jisu mina maadibe nah pa ledeukelume dage marang gai, <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />Pa rangdi, “Laisiukecime nah Phariseeme Moses bam ga bamla. <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />Cine penui nnuide tei lulo rang kebeu leune mzai, nah ma cidungde mnei lu maisia. Dede penui tadung nzwa tei so, kedanemene penui ledeu la, dede penui tei mzai la melu. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Penui hepüt kerütdung, nah pung pa gai kelakdung kanglu delwe mina hekeutudung gage penui mpüt kai beula. Dede penui zurang le de cidungde deu kelai neu de lama. <verse eid="MAT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />Penui ta leune peu mina de ngau kerane tei lala. Kedanemene penui kesanglaisiu samdumdung de teimdi, nah penui pairidung de penui tei mtie eh lala. <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />Penui ketaktyei ngyidung ga heni yitubedung nah synagoguedung ga hebam ditubedung ga bam neula, <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />nah litaknidung gade mine kelum kecu nah ‘Keledeubo’ de kequ penui suiyi la. <verse eid="MAT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />Dede mide peu nnuide ‘Keledeubo,’ de quso, kedanemene nnui keledeube au ket nah nnui pelane au ciaherei swacingme ciau lu. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Nah kideu ga nnui hangge dede ‘Peibo,’ de eh quso, kedanemene nnui pei au tinggim ga kebambe rünne gwale melu. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Nnuide peu, ‘Keledeubo,’ de eh quso, kedanemene Khrista rünne nnui keledeube kecune. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Dede nnui kakgade ditube de peu nnui kila teizie. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Keheibe de pekatei pecu tei cehu kecube de tei henah dizie, nah keheibe de pekatei pecu tei henah kelabe de tei cehu beuzie.<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />Dede ainie nnui laisiukecime nah Phariseeme, nah hezai teikelame! Nnui tinggim hegwangram minadung ziemne ngkui dida. Kedanemene nnuikatei de cika lüt lama, nah cika lütlai eh kelamede de nnui peu lüt lama kecune. <verse eid="MAT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kehegwa laisiudung kesa ga pedum 14 keraile de si (kesa laisiudung samkie aide pedum 12 caiga kaila).</char></note>[Ainie nnui, laisiukecime nah Phariseeme, hezaiketeime! Kedanemene nnui hemipuime mabamdung tyei lula, delwe nnui hezaitei eh kekie tei tiela.] Ciziemne nnui saja hungki kecu ngau zie. <verse eid="MAT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />Ainie keherei nnuida gwang zieda! Laisiukecime nah Phariseeme, hezaiketeime! Kedanemene nnui mige lung tei nreulu kerane jaaidi nah hangdeu kecangdung kah gwangla, nah pa ciciu luge, nnui pecu mijaai ga gwang kera nnui kena kiee ge tei beula.<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />Ainie nnui, nnui miakcitme puisau tei kelame, nnui, ‘Keheibe de kerecaki de teu reset cai, cide magede ma. Dede keheibe de kerecaki kecak de teu reset cai, pe reset cide ne pecu kangla,’ de eh rang kelame. <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Nnui kemiemedung nah miakcietmedung! Kecakbe mi kecak teimci beukela kerecakibe diki no? <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Nah nnui, ‘Keheibede recabam de teu eh reset cai, cide au magede ma. Dede keheibe racabam reuga mtamapeu kebam de teu reset kecucai, pe reset cide ne pecu kangla,’ de eh rangla. <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Nnui kemiemedung nah miakcietmedung! Mapeube dimi mi mapeu de teimci kebeu recabambe diki no? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Ciziemne, keheibe de recabam de teu reset cai, cide nah cika kebam pelane teu reset dida. <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />Mige kerecaki de teu reset kelabe, cide nah cika lungh kebambe de teu reset dida. <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />Nah mige tinggim teu eh reset kelabe Tinggwang hegwangbam nah cika kebambe de teu reset dida.<verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />Ainie nnui, laisiukecime nah Phariseeme, hezaiketeime! Kedanemene nnui gi ceheibwa mihui nah dill nah cumin zikerei tei eh zige pwa peula, dede nnui hezai ga mtingki kecu, kemzeu nah ngaugia nah kenlum aidungde be tei mene gi dila. Dede nnui aidungde de tei kerabe, kedabedung de gidi mene. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Nnui miakcietme puisaumedung, nnui tamaine de au tim dila dede ut de au nneu lula!<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />Ainie nnui, laisiukecime nah Phariseeme, hezaiketeime! Kedanemene nnui hepiak nah hekwak hegwale au teimci dila, dede helungle au makehengin nah miziukeci le puipung bam. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Nnui miakciet Phariseemedung! Nnui hepiak nah hekwak helunglebie be huimci<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:26 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">helunglebie be huimci </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jisu penuide ledeu kecu cide milung be tei mci railu maisia, ciude hegwale zai mci nah mci gi luzie.</char></note> rai dilu, ciciu de cide hegwalebie de mcidi lubui.<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />Ainie nnui, laisiukecime nah Phariseeme, hezaiketeime! Nnui au heraudung hui ha pwa kebamde nzwa delie, cide hegwale de ngau hezuyi bamla, dede helung lebie de au ketsaime radung nah mci kemakbe leune pui bamla. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Cikesiak ge, nnui de mi dwade au kesamsangme nzwala, dede helung lebie au hezaiketei nah kesia le nnuide puipung.<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />Ainie nnui, laisiukecime nah Phariseeme, hezaiketeime! Nnui caihakecime raudung tei nah masang kelame raudung tei hezuyi bamla. <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />Nnui, ‘Anui anui paume tingdau lungh liecai, anui caihakecime jai teilwa kecu ga penuide ncütlak nage,’ de eh rangla. <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Cine nnuikatei nnui caihakecime de dapketsetme name lie zierang tei bamla. <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Nnui de nnui paumedung bata de teipui cang lulo. <verse eid="MAT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />Nnui heneidung, nnui neiduipui leuhmedung, nnui dainzwa eh mijaai tutiak gade mbailu laino? <verse eid="MAT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Cine, ainie, Ih nnui dage caihakecime nah makecime nah laisiukecime de langgai zeu. Nnui kangge de teitset nah gwaktset, nah kangge de synagoguedung gade dap nah penuide namdi ge gade namdi ge gage gwa gaizie. <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />Cine makesangme jai kideu reuga teilwa kegai pelane nnui reu ga gwang zie, kesamsangbe Abel jai gade gwang, Barachiah napei Zechariah, nnui kemcini nah recabam kakgade daptset kedibe jai kecang. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Ih nnui dage rangsiakte gaila, ma aidungde pelane ceheu aipaude reuga gwang zie.<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />Jerusalem, Jerusalem, caihakecime nah n dage langkegaime de teitset nah tangtsu le sam kelabo! Nruipui pe name de pe hesiu kang gage gumlu kela nzwa, Ih daikenzwa gede n name de teu hekwalu neu no, dede nnui rau dida! <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Ainie, nnui kerecaki gi dida nah mtamrwa dida. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />Kedanemene Ih nnui dage rangla, nnui acu cu gade ngausi lakta, nnui, ‘Rampaube zi gade kegwangbe au samlam pungtu lie!’”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leidung 118:26</char></note> de eh rang kemaktane.<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s">Tingtün zasidung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Jisu kerecaki gade tet mpet keladau, pa ledeukelume pecu kereca kidung saulia zie lie gwang. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Dede penui dage rangdi, “Nnui aidungde ngau meni? Ih nnui dage rangsiakte gaila, cidungde tei msia ciak dizie. Tangtsu gede kedage reuga keswa pwa bamlak.”<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Pa Olive Deutu reu gwang bam luge, pa ledeukelumedung ngkim peda gwang ranggai, “Daidau aidungde tei gwang ziebi anuide ranglia lo? Nang gwang daikera nah kideu cangdi kera marehi de daikenzwa ge zieno?” <verse eid="MAT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Jisu penui sam keligai, “Nnuide peu mide cwadi melu kerane sünne lulo. <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Kedanemene mi kekiee ge a zi teu eh gwang zie. Penui, ‘Ih Khristabe delie,’ de eh rang zie, nah mi kekiee gede cwa dizie. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Nnui hereudung ketei nah hereudung ketei ha kerang de siu zie. Dede nnui lung keherei diso, kedanemene aidungde gwang bi maisia; dede penlibe au mereu. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Heleuh ge heleuh keda gede ngaurau, nah hegwang ge hegwang kedage de ngaurau dizie. Heni ketsamtsam ga herakum kum nah nnui teu dizie. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Dede aidungde au hena kemna tedteei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hena kemna tedteei: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kehereisüt kecu pendeube</char></note> keraibede cai sima. <verse eid="MAT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />Pecai penui nnuide pwa tei keherei nah nnuide teitset dizie. Heleuh leune nnuide a zi ziemne ngaurau dizie. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />Pecai mi kekiee ge kau dizie, nah hangge ge de cwa nah ngkau dizie. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Kenret caihakecime kekiee ge cuh zie nah kekiee gede cwateu dizie. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Kedanemene kesiabe kiee reureu dizie, nah mi kekiee ge kekukehung ngkung dizie. <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />Dede penli kecang liakelube de au kelilu zie. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Hegwangram samliakeyi aide kideu pelane dage pau zie, heleuh pelane dage zierang tei eh. Pecai penlibe gwang zie.<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />Ciziemne, nnui makesia kengkau ketei, caihakecibe Daniel ne kerangde, kemci ni ga sap eh ngau keludau” (peu kepeime de ci lulo),<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dan. 9.27; 11.31; 12.11.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />iciude Judea ga kebamme de peu lamlwatudung ga pakgai dilu, <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />peu kiniem ga kebambe de pe ki gade magede keulu zie lie nghung so, <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />nah pe luh ga kelabe de peu pe pai keu kera cailigwang so. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Dede cipau tingdau mipui tetlak kelame nah nepam kelame ziemne ainie! <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Nnui kepak tingde tingtiak mede Sabbath benai melu kerane kekie teilu. <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Kedanemene cipaucai keherei süt kecu gwang zie, kideu ndeu kelu gade cu kecang, mede pecaide teidai kelak reirei zie. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Cipau tingba ziedung de teimduidi mecai, migede de keliu gailak. Dede kedetkelume ziemne, cipau tingba ziedung de teimdui dizie. <verse eid="MAT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />Ciu eh mige ncu, ‘Ainie, aika Khrista bam!’ mede, ‘Pa cika bamda!’ de eh rang de cide nlum so. <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Kedanemene Khrista kemak nah kenret caihakecimedung gwang zie nah marehi kedi nah miswakegahdung tei liazie, iciu eh teilu buicai, kedetkelumedung de de cwateu dilu kerane. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Ainie, Ih nnui dage nrai ranglia zeu delie. <verse eid="MAT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />Ciziemne, penui nnui dage, ‘Ainie, pa au hetaideu gala,’ de rangde cika mie so. Mede, ‘Pielo, pa kibung pelung ga bam,’ de rangde cide de nlum helo. <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />Naimiak kepetlede ting hepik kegai naimiak kenlüt le de ngau gwang kela nzwa, Mina Nabe kegwang de ciciu zie. <verse eid="MAT 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />Makaune tsai kebam leuga, heraruidung gwang ngkwa bamzie.<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />Dede keherei ciciu kedicai zette tingnaimiak mui dizie, nah hekei baabeu ta dizie, nah heghidung tinggim gade cakmie zie, nah tinggim kengkieng de teu kelai dizie. <verse eid="MAT 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />Pecai Mina Nabe rehi tinggim gade ngau dizie, nah pecai kideu ga heleuh leune hap dizie. Penui Mina Nabe kengkieng nah kendu kedige teu delwe hemwa reu gade kegwang ngauzie. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />Khrista pe tinggimgwamedung de langgai eh telui kwa sahbak gaizie, nah penui kedetkelume de tinggim kungdung mdai lebie de hekwa luzie, tinggim penli ket lamde keda lambie kecang.<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />Samgwa aide tangzüttsi bang gade ci lulo. Pe kiak renu kedi dau nah penei bwapet dai kecu dau, nnui hepwakting nna dida de kecu cilu la. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Cinzwa eh, nnui ma aidungde pelane ngau kelu dau, nnui Khrista nna dida nah heriekidung ga bam dida de kecu cilu maisia. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Ih nnui dage rangsiakte gaila, ma aidungde tei gwang canglu kemaktane aipau ceheu de gahdi lak. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Tinggim nah kideu gah dizie, dede a samdung au madaude gah dilak.<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Migede petingba nah pebamdakkak cima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />Dede cipau tingba nah pe bamdakkak de migede cima, tinggimgwame de nah Nabe de, Apei rünne gwale. <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Noah tingdau nzwa, Mina Nabe kegwang daude cinzwa zie. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Kedanemene cipau tingdau, duinai kegwang dwa, penui matyei nah sak bam, nah henautei hemeumeu bam, Noah liem ga nlüt kecu benai kecang, <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />nah duinai gwang penui pelane de tiapung tetdi kemaktane penui magede cima, Mina Nabe kegwang dau de cinzwa zie. <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />Cidau hangna luh ge ga lazie, hangge de ngngwa teu dizie, nah hangge de gidi zie. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Mipui hangna ciu tau bamzie, hangge de ngngwa teu dizie, nah hangge de gi dizie. <verse eid="MAT 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />Ciziemne nnui mriak bam lulo, kedanemene nnui Rampaube daipau nai gwang zie bi nnui ci melu. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Dede aide cilu, ki mpaube keregabe daipau tingdau gwang zie bi kecu ci liecai, pa kwabam zie nah peu pe ki mide raklüt lak. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Ciziemne, nnui de mtei lwe bamlu maisia, kedanemene Mina Nabe nnui cet mene kebam bamdakkak ga gwang zielu.<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />Ciciu cai samsang nah kemteu kilabe cau no, pe mpaube pe kilungme de pie rengei nah peting siakdau taktyei peu kera kengkieng kepeube de? <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Pe mpaube kegwang dau, aidungde tei bam eh ngaukelu kilabe au samlam pungtu lie. <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Ih nnui dage rangsiakte gaila, pe mpaube cipaude de pe gudung pelane pierengei kera peuzie. <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Dede kila kesiabe, pe lung gade, ‘A mpaube gwang ri dida,’ de eh rang <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />delwe pe zangme kila kedadung de dap cai, nah zau kesakme de ngngwa tyei nah sak bam cai, <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />pecai kila cipaude mning mezing kebam dau nah pe bamdakkak ci kemak tingdau pe mpaube gwangzie. <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />Pa pecu dang kecai dizie delwe hezaiteiketeime da peu bam dizie, kehap nah geigim pung kebam ga.<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s">Releime kerei samgwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />Pecai Tinggim hegwangram au relei kemcime hangkerei penui mitaubung pwalwe lakciube de dau zielie mie kecu nzwa delie. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Penui hangmengei bau au mie nah hangmengei bau au mriak. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Kedanemene kemieme bau de penui mitaubung pwa keludau, penui midui gede keusi ma. <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />Dede kemriakme bau penui mitaubung nah miduibung gage midui keusilu. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Lakciubepei gwang ridi ge, penui ziangmui eh zip kapdi. <verse eid="MAT 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />Dede tingmui muisum dau mage sahbak eh, ‘Ainie, lakciube! Tetpet delwe pecu redau lulo.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />Ge relei kemcimedung de cuhlu delwe penui mitaubung mtei kaplu. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />Kemieme bau kemriakme bau dade kiedi, ‘Nnui midui kesa anuide peulo, kedanemene anui mitaubungdung mmütdi zeu delu.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />Dede kemriakmebau sam keligai, ‘Anui nah nnui ziemne cang gailak ta. Kezwame da mie delwe nnui ziemne lui lulo.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />Penui lui zie lie mie kedidau, lakciubepei gwang eh mtei teu kebamme de ngngwa meunui ngyi ga mi di, nah kikambe ngkuidi. <verse eid="MAT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />Pecai releime kedame bau gwang eh rangdi, ‘Kedibo, kedibo, anuide kikam ngkei beulo.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />Dede pa sam keligai, ‘Ih nnui dage rangsiakte gaila, Ih nnuide cima.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />Cine kwabam lulo, kedanemene nnui pe tingba mede pe bamdakkak ci melu.<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Talentdung samgwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />Tinggim hegwangram au mige hebeuh tei lai kezeu dau, pe kilamedung de qulwe pe mabam penui ba gage kaikebeu nzwa delie. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />Pa hangge de kecak geu cang mengei peu, kedage de kecak geu cang na, nah kedage de kecak geu cang ge peu. Pa penui hange ge kecu de teilukebui nsam gade nzi beudi, delwe pe beuh ga tet jüja miedi. <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Kecak geu cang mengei ngau kelube de mie delwe heli tei eh keda kecak geu cang mengei ge tei silu. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Cinzwa eh kecak geu cang na ngau kelube de kecak geu cang na mmi silu. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Dede kecak geu cang ge ngau kelube de mie hangdeu kuilu, delwe pe mpaube rangkang de kebai nzeudi. <verse eid="MAT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />Peting ketiee ge cai cipau kilamedung mpaube cailigwang delwe penuide qugai, penui pe rangkang teu daitei lubi kecu keteu kerane. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Kecak geu cang mengei ngau kelube de kecak geu mengei keu gwang silu. Pa rangdi, ‘Kedibo, nang acu kecak geu mengei peu. Dede ainie, Ih kecak geu cang mengei ge tei sidai luda.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />Pe mpaube pe dage ranggai, ‘Tei dau da, kila keyi kesamsangbo! Nang makecam nage gade de samsang kelune. Ih ncu ma kekiee ge reu keteube tei beuzie. Gwang n mpaube suiyi mzi lulo.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />Kecak geu cang na ngau kelube de gwang eh rangdi, ‘Kedibo, nang acu kecak geu kena peu. Dede ainie, Ih kecak geu cang na ge tei sidai luda.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />Pe mpaube pe dage rangdi, ‘Tei hemi da, kila keyi kesamsangbo! Nang makecam gade de samsang kelune. Ih peu ncu ma kekiee ge reu keteube tei beuzie. N mpaube suiyi mzi lulo.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />Pecai kecak geu cang ge ngau kelube de gwang lu rangdi, ‘Kedibo, Ih nang au mtingsüt kecu mege kecu ci. Nang ling gai kemak gade de rumla, nah teizanggai kemak gade de luhlüt la. <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />Ih ngngidi, cine Ih mie delwe hangdeu gage n gu kecak geu de kebai nzeudi. Ainie, ngu aika bam delie.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />Dede pe mpaube sam keligai, ‘Nang kesia nah kenghet kilabo, Ih ling gai kemak gade de rumla, nah tei zanggai kemak gade de luhlüt la kecu nang cicai. <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />Ciciu cai nang a rangkang pwa rangkang keteume de peudi kerabe, nah Ih cailigwang kecudau Ih agu rangkang gage pekaide si eh ngaulu kera ge. <verse eid="MAT 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />Ciziemne pe dade kecak geu de keu dilu delwe kecak geu cang kerei kebam kilabe de peu dilu. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Kedanemene keheibe de kebambe de peu si zie, nah pa kieesüt bam luzie. Dede kegahbe keheibe dade kecam nage kebamde de peda de keudai teu dizie. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Kemta kilabe de hegwale kemui gage kelien gaidi, kehap nah geigim pung kebam gage.’<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Meurün nah Hemeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />Mina Nabe hecili eh pe tinggimgwame de ngngwa eh kegwang dau, pa hegwangbam kendu ga bamzie. <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Pe dwaga heleuh leune gwang ngkwa zie, nah pa mina de keu ntsam dizie, meurün kekwabe meurünna de hemeudung kakgade keumpet camdi kela nzwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />Pa meurünna de pe ba zetle ge kaizie, dede hemeudung de au pe hile ge kai dizie. <verse eid="MAT 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />Pecai hegwangpei pe zetle kebammedung dage rang zie, ‘Gwanglu, a Pei Tinggwang ne samlam kebeumedung, kideu damkelu gade nnui ziemne mtei teukela hegwangram de gum lulo. <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />Kedanemene Ih mzeu lage nnui acu matyei kera peu; Ih hereu lage nnui acu sak kera peu; Ih sangme ge teila ge nnui acu hegia beu; <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />Ih paula lage nnui acu pai bah beu; Ih teeinei lage nnui acu ngkwet beu; Ih hebaang tei lage nnui a da gwang.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />Pecai makesangme pe sam keli eh rangzie, ‘Rampaubo, nang daidau mzeula eh ngau eh anui ncu peu matyei no? Mede hereula eh ncu sak kera peuno? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Nah daidau nang sangtei kela ngau eh ncu hegia no? Mede paula eh ncu pai bah beuno? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Nah nang daidau teeinei nah hebaang tei la eh anui ncu ngau eh n da gwang no?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />Pecai Hegwangpei penuide samkeli eh rangzie, ‘Ih nnui dage rangsiakte gaila, nnui a siname keceu aidungde dage tei kegaidungde a dage teigai delie.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />Pecai pa pe hile kebamme dage rangzie, ‘A dade tet dilu, nnui reset kepungme, tetpwa madaude mütdi kelak mijaai, herakesiabe nah pe gwame ziemne mtei pwa kebam ga gwang dilo, <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />kedanemene Ih mzeu la, dede nnui magede tyei kera pwa acu peu ma; Ih hereu la, dede nnui sak kera ma gede acu pwapeu ma; <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />Ih sangtei la, dede nnui acu hegia beuma; paula la, dede nnui acu pai bah beu ma; teeinei la nah hebaang teila, dede nnui a mapie ma.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />Pecai penui de keligai zie, ‘Rampaubo, daidau ge nang mzeu, mede hereu, mede sangme tei, mede paaula, mede teeinei, mede hebaang teikela ngau eh anui ncu ngha meno?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />Pecai pa penui samkeli eh rangzie, ‘Ih nnui dage rangsiakte gaila, nnui keceu aidungde dage teigai kemakte a dage de teigai mede lie.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />Jisu ranggai, aidungde au kelungta keherei kera ga gwang dizie, dede makesangme au kelungta kering ga gwang dizie.”<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s">Jisu de kemmau mariem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Jisu sam aidungde rang cang dige, pa ledeukelumedung dage rangdi, <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />“Nnui ci kebam nzwa, langnane cai Kahkegwang Ngyi de gwang zieda nah Mina Nabe de gwaktsetdi kerane nim gaibeu dizie.” <verse eid="MAT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Cidau cingku kedime nah hangkiame cingku kedibe, Caiaphas lie qu kelabe ki ga gwang ngkwa bam. <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />Penui Jisu de ngkimkak eh tuilu delwe teitsetdi kera ciem ngngwa riem bam. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Penui hange ge dage rang eh, “Hengyi tingdau lak, iciu eh mina kakga ma kehebwak petdi melu kerane.”<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bethany gade Jisu de keniakkelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Cidau Jisu Bethany ga, ndaa mpabe kelabe Simon ki ga bamge, <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />pa matyei kebam dau, mipui ge<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mipui ge: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mipui aide Mary, Lazarus nah Martha sinabe pui. (Jn 12:13)</char></note> maca pemi kewhung alabaster bung ge pwa gwang delwe pa pe peu gage ruigai. <verse eid="MAT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Dede pa ledeukelumedung cide ngau luge, penui rata eh ranggai, “Daitie aiciu matei ngkap lano? <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />Aide pemi yisüt eh zwa lubui delwe makegahme de rangkang peu lubui.” <verse eid="MAT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Dede Jisu, aide ci eh, penuide dage rangdi, “Daitei aipau puide de nnui kebwak zeu no? Pa a ziemne heta keyi ge teigai da. <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Nnui makegahme de au ngngwa bam muizie, dede nnui acu ngngwa bammui lak. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Pa maca a pum ga ruigai kecu de, pa acu kungkera mtei bam da. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Ih nnui dage rangsiakte gaila, kideu pelane ga samliakeyi aide rang kegwang leu ga, mipui aide de kensung gade pa tei kegai tade de rangla dizie.”<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judas Jisu de tuibeu kera samdaukelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Cidau kereiekena bau hangge, Judas Iscariot lie qu kelabe, cingku kedimedung da mie <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />delwe rangdi, “Nang acu daipai ge peu zie no, Ih pecu nnui dage tuigai beucai?” Penui rangkang geu camrei pecu peudi. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Cipaude pa pecu cwa kera ziuyi keyi ge peei ladi.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rampaube de kensungtaktyei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Pecai Tsehi Kaikemak Tangku ngyi raitu benai ledeukelumedung Jisu da gwang keteugai, “Daiga ge anuide peu n ziemne kahkegwang Ngyi taktyei de tyei kera mteibeu neuno?” <verse eid="MAT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Pa rangdi, “Namdi ga mige da mie delwe peda rang beulo, ‘Keledeube rang zeulie, “A ting nna zeu da. Ih Kahkegwang ngyi de n ki gade Ih ledeukelumedung de ngngwa mnei zielie.”’” <verse eid="MAT 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Ledeukelumedung Jisu rang kebeu caisui eh kahkegwang taktyei de mteilu.<verse eid="MAT 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Tinghegi miege, pa ledeukelume kereiekena bau de ngngwa matyei kera bamlu. <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />Penui matyei kebam ge, pa ranggai, “Ih nnui dage rangsiakte gaila, nnui hangge acu tui gaibeu zie.” <verse eid="MAT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Penui suisia sütdi nah hangge ge kecu pecu, “Ih ni, Rampaubo?” de keteu kapdi. <verse eid="MAT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Pa sam keligai, “Acu ngngwa hekwak gage peba mpung kecube de ne acu tuigai beuzie. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Kesanglaisiu ga pe ha raupwa kebam nzwa, Mina Nabe au tsai dizie. Dede Mina Nabe de tuigai kerabede au ainie! Pecu mna kemakbe pe ziemne yiki kerage.” <verse eid="MAT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Cu Judas, pecu tuigai beu kerabe de samkeligai, “Cide Ih ni, Keledeubo?” Pa pe dage rangdi, “Nang rang dauda.”<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Penui matyei bamge, Jisu tangku keulu, delwe samlamgai, eh teuraklu. Pa cide ledeukelumedung de peu eh ranggai, “Keulwe tyeilo. Aide a pumteih delie.” <verse eid="MAT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Pecai pa hepiak pwalu delwe samlamgai, delwe penuide peu eh ranggai, “Nnui pelane cide pwa saklo. <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />Kedanemene aide mi kekiee mau gilu kera samting samkakkelu a jailwa kegaide delie. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Dede Ih nnui dage rang gaila, Ih aipau kubetsidui de madaude sak dai lakta, a Pei hegwangram gade kubetsidui keheci nnuide ngngwa sak kemakta.” <verse eid="MAT 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Pecai penui lei ge teigai eh penui Olive deutu reuga hangdi.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Peter pecu mlaikera mraikerang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Pecai penui Jisu dage rangdi, “Heziu nnui pelane acu gidi zie. Kedanemene Kesanglaisiu ga ainzwa raupwa bam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 26:31">‘Ih meurünkekwabe de dap gaizie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 26:31">nah meurün hau pak zangra dizie.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zechariah 13:7</char></note><verse eid="MAT 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />Dede Ih ringcuh dailu kecucai, Ih nnui dwarai delwe Galilee ga mie dizie.”<verse eid="MAT 26:32" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Dede Peter pe dage rangdi, “Pelane ncu gidi liede Ih madaude ncu gidi lak.” <verse eid="MAT 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Ge Jisu pe dage rangdi, “Ih n dage rangsiakte gaila, heziu nruirie kwa kemak dwa nang acu pia cum mlai dizie.” <verse eid="MAT 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Peter pe dage rangdi, “Ih ncu ngngwa tsai zie liede, Ih ncu mlai dilak.” Ledeukelumedung kedame ciciu kapdi.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gethsemane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Pecai Jisu Gethsemane lie qu kela ni gega penuide ngngwa miedi, delwe ledeukelumedung dage rangdi, “Aika bamlu Ih mie kekie ketei tingkak.” <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Pa Peter nah Zebedee napei kena de ngngwalu nah peda suisiet nah lungrei le puidi. <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />Pecai pa penui dage rangdi, “A rabe suisiet le puipung eh tsaidi lai zeuda. Aika bamlu delwe acu ngngwa kwalu.” <verse eid="MAT 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Pa ma nage tetpet silu delwe keumie pe zu nkum punglwe kiegai, “A Pei, teilu buicai, aipau keherei piakde de a dade keu mbaidi lulo. Ciulie de a suibe so, dede n suibe tei lulo.” <verse eid="MAT 26:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Pecai ledeukelumedung da gwang ge penui zip bam eh ngaulu, nah pa Peter dage rangdi, “Nnui bamdakkak gede acu ngngwa kwa gailak zing deni? <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />Kwa eh kiebam lulo, nnui mdakkepie ga lütdi melu kerane. Rabe au neu bam kesang, dede pumteihbe au mnei.” <verse eid="MAT 26:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Pa pekenabe mie delwe kekie teidai. Pa rangdi, “A Pei, aipaude Ih sak mene ta gailak cai, n suibe tei lulo.” <verse eid="MAT 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Pa mpet dai ge penui zip bam eh ngaulu, penui zip na zu kedine. <verse eid="MAT 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Cine penuide gidai di eh, pedwa samdung nzwa eh pa mie pia pekecumbe kekie tei dai. <verse eid="MAT 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Pecai Jisu ledeukelumedung da gwang eh penui dade rangdi, “Nnui cude zip eh mtak bam reuni? Ainie, pe bamdakkak gwang nna la dida, nah Mina Nabe de tuipwa kemaumedung ba gage kaidi kera. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Cuhlu, anui tet cugo. Ainie, acu tuigai beu kerabe de nnala dida.”<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu de tuikelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Pa marang kebam dau, ainie, Judas, kereiekena bau gade hangge gwang. Pecu cingkume nah hangkiamedung ne lang kegai hemaa maadi ge, kiengtie nah tsingpakdung pwa kelame nzang la. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Jisu de tuigai beu kerabe de, penuide pe ciem teilia gai eh, “Ih kemam kegaibe de, cide pa delie. Pecu tuilu,” debeu. <verse eid="MAT 26:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Ge pa Jisu da kelwa gwang rangdi, “Kelum gaila, Keledeubo!” delwe pa pecu kemam gai. <verse eid="MAT 26:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Jisu pe dage rangdi, “Azangbo, nang tei zielie gwang kelade tei lulo.” Pecai penui gwang Jisu de heraklu delwe pecu tuilu. <verse eid="MAT 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Ainie, Jisu de ngngwa kelame hangge, pe ba kezang pet pe kiengtie zütlu eh cingku kedibe kilabe de bi eh pe kwen dangdi. <verse eid="MAT 26:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Pecai Jisu pe dage rangdi, “N kiengtie pebung gage kaidai di, kedanemene kingtie kepwame de kingtie le ngkap dizie kecune. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Mi nang Ih a Pei dage kiegai cai, pa piage gage tinggimgwame reugwamaa kereiekena swade kiee eh acu langgai beugai laklie cetbam ni? <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Dede ciciu cai, dainzwa Kesanglaisiu ga teigwang zielie de raupwa kelade tei canglu laino?” <verse eid="MAT 26:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Cipau tingdau Jisu maadibe dage rangdi, “Keregame gede tui kera nzwa nnui kiengtie nah tsingpakdung keu delwe acu tui kera gwangla ni? Tingnai ramsangne Ih kerecaki ga mide ledeu bam bamla, iciu de nnui acu tui ma. <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Dede aidungde pelane aiciu kecu au caihakecime raupwa kelade teicang lu kerane.” Pecai ledeukelumedung pelane pecu gidi eh pakdi.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Sanhendrin dwaga kesap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Jisu de tui teu kelame pecu cingku kedibe Caiaphas taiga ngngwa gwang, cika laisiukecime nah hangkiamedung gwang ngkwa bam. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Dede Peter Jisu de kemdei gade pecai sui eh cingku kedibe kigu ga gwanglu. Pa dainzwa di ziebi kecu pie kerane pelung ga lütlwe kekwame de ngngwa bam. <verse eid="MAT 26:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Cu cingku kedime nah baudibe pelane Jisu de mmau kera kenret zierang pei bam, iciu eh penui pecu teitset lu kerane. <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />Kenret zierang keteime kekiee ge gwang liede, penui kette peei dau luma. Dede kekamle hangna gwang <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />delwe ranggai, “Aipau mina de, ‘Ih Tinggwang kerecaki de tei msiadi eh langcumne gage teidai lubui,’ de eh ranggai.” <verse eid="MAT 26:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Cingku kedibe cuh saplu delwe pe dage rangdi, “Nang keligai kera gahni? Penui ncu kemmau zierang tei kebam de daino?” <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Dede Jisu zing de bamdi. Cingku kedibe pe da rangdi, “Ih ringkebam Tinggwang zi gade ncu aja kaigai la, nang Tinggwang Nabe, Khrista, demi mebi kecu anui dage rang lialo.” <verse eid="MAT 26:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Jisu pe sam keligai, “Nang kerang deda. Dede Ih nnui dage rang gaila, cu gade nnui Mina Nabe Kengkiengbe ba zetle kebam, nah tinggim hemwadung reu gade kegwang ngau zie.” <verse eid="MAT 26:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Pecai cingku kedibe pe paini hietdi eh ranggai, “Pa Tinggwang de rang msia zeu! Daitei anui cude zierang keusi maisia bamreu no? Pielo, cu nnui pa Tinggwang de rangkemsia sam siu luda. <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />Nnui daipai cetno?” Penui sam keligai, “Pa tsaidi kerabe.” <verse eid="MAT 26:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Pecai penui pe zu gage mcai nsuilwa nah pecu dap, nah kangge pecu kepeu eh, <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />ranggai, “Anui dage caihakecisam ranglo, Khrista. Caune ncu kepeu au no?”<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s">Peter Jisu de mlaikedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Cidau Peter hegwa lebie kigu ga bam. Kila puina ge peda gwang eh rangdi, “Nang de Galileeme Jisu de ngngwa la.” <verse eid="MAT 26:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Dede pa penui pelane dwagade cide mlai eh ranggai, “Nang daipai rang zeu bi Ih cima,” <verse eid="MAT 26:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Pecai pa kirie ga mpet ge, kila pui keda ge pecu ngau eh cika kebamme dage rangdi, “Mina aipaude de Nazarethme Jisu de ngngwa lalie.” <verse eid="MAT 26:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Pa sampet eh mlai daidi, “Ih mina cipaude de ci ma!” de eh. <verse eid="MAT 26:72" /><verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Pecai tie mene cika sap kebamme gwang delwe Peter dage rangdi, “Nang penui kakga hangge kesanglie, kedanemene n samrang gade ncu cilu da.” <verse eid="MAT 26:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Ge pa reset nah sampet cuh eh, “Ih mina cipaude de cima,” dedi. Ge zette nrui kwadi. <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />Cidau Peter Jisu pe dage, “Nrui kwa kemak dwa nang acu pia cum mlai zie,” de eh rang kebeu samdung de nsunglu. Pa hegwale petlu delwe hap sütdi.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s">Judas ngkak tsaikedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Pecai benai tingcang nuge, cingkumedung nah hangkiamedung pelane Jisu de teitsetdi kera ciem riem bamdi. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Jewme muiteume pecu kanglu, delwe pecu teu tetdi, delwe pecu deuceudibe Pilate dage kai beudi.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Pecai Judas, Jisu de tuigai kebeube de, Jisu de mmaukedi ci luge, pa pe maupet eh rangkanggeu camrei de cingkumedung nah hangkiame dungde pwacaili gwangbeu eh ranggai, <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />“Ih mau kemakbe de tuigai beu eh kemau tei dida.” Dede penui rangdi, “Cide anui zie ma? Nang nkatei cetlu.” <verse eid="MAT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Pecai pa rangkanggeudung de kerecaki gage kelien gaidi eh, tetdi, delwe mie pekatei ngkak tsaidi. <verse eid="MAT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Cingkumedung rangkanggeudung de keulu eh rangdi, “Aide kerecaki mabam gage kaikera hezai meda kedanemene cide au hejai mi kecune.” <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Penui makie aide ngngwa mpaulu delwe rangkang de le liketeibe luh luilu, sangme raukie ge tei kerane. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Aipau kiede ziemne henai kecang de cipau luhde de, “Hejai luh”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hejai luh: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hejai mi le luh lui kelude. Bata 1:19.</char></note> lie qula. <verse eid="MAT 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Ciciu eh caihakecibe Jeremiah sam, “Penui rangkanggeu camrei de keulu, Israel namedung ne pemi riet pwa kebam de, <verse eid="MAT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />delwe penui cide le liketeibe luh luilu, Rampaube acu rang kebeu nzwa,”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jeremiah 32:6-15; Zechariah 11:12-13</char></note> de eh rang kenzeu de teicanglu.<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Pilate dwaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Jisu deuceudi dwa ga sap, nah deuceudi pecu keteu eh, “Nang Jewme hegwangpei deni?” Jisu keligai, “Nang kerang de da.” <verse eid="MAT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />Dede cingkumedung nah hangkiamedung Jisu de mmau cuh ge, pa magede keli ma. <verse eid="MAT 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Pecai Pilate pe dage rangdi, “Penui ncu mmau kebam ma aidung pelane nang siu meni?” <verse eid="MAT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Dede pa pecu mmau kebam samdung de kette keli ma, cine deuceudibe pe swagah sütdi. <verse eid="MAT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Cu Kahkegwang Ngyi ramsangne deuceudibe hemaabe suibe hebaangme hangge de lungmpet beu kecu hezai. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Cipau tingdau mteici kecu hebaangme ge, Barabbas lie kecu ge bam. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Cine hemaabe gwang ngkwa luge, Pilate penui dage rangdi, “Nnui ziemne acu peu cau de lungmpet beu neu no? Barnabbas mi Khrista lie qu kelabe Jisu zie no?” <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Kedanemene penui Jisu de ngau penui riak eh nimpwa pe ba gage kai kenzeu pa ci kebamne. <verse eid="MAT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Pa tutiakbam ga kebam dau, pe nau pe dage sam langgai eh rangdi, “Nang maukemak cipau peide dage magede teigai so. Kedanemene Ih nzieziu amang lamde cipau peide ziemne keherei sütlie.” <verse eid="MAT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Cu cingkukedime nah hangkiamedung, Barabbas de kie kera, dede Jisu de teitsetdi lo kie kera hemaabe lung teigai beu. <verse eid="MAT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Deuceudibe penui dage ranggai, “Aipau kena kakgade caude de peu acu lungmpet beu neu no?” Ge penui rangdi, “Barabbas,” <verse eid="MAT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Pilate penui dade rangdi, “Ciciu cai Khrista lie qu kelabe Jisu de Ih daipai tei laino?” Penui pelane keligai, “Pecu gwaktsetdi.” <verse eid="MAT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Pecai pa rangdi, “Daitei no? Pa daipai mau tei pwabam no?” Dede penui, “Pecu gwaktset dilu,” de sah mtei reureu di. <verse eid="MAT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Pilate pa magede teigai kelak ngau luge, meliene kehebwak cuh laidi. Cine pa maadibe dwade dui pwalwe pe ba mtiak eh ranggai, “Mina aipaude jai ziemne au Ih mzui cangsiak lie, cide nnui katei cet lulo.” <verse eid="MAT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Mina pelane keligai, “Peu pe jai anui reu nah anui name reu ga gwang lulo.” <verse eid="MAT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Pecai pa penui de Barabbas de lungmpet beudi, dede pa Jisu de dap delwe pecu gwaktset kera peudi.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Reugwame Jisu de henuiketei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Pecai deuceudibe reugwame Jisu de kedibe kilung ga ngngwa nlütlu delwe reugwame pelane de peu gwang pedwa twagwalu. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Penui pe painidung radi delwe pai giereba pecu peu bahlu. <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />Penui hetu peurwa ge teilwe cide pe peu gage kaigai, nah tsingtie ge pe ba zetle ge kaibeu. Penui pedwa keumie pecu henui tei eh rangdi, “Jewme Gwangpei ring teilo!” <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Penui pecu mcai msuilwa, nah tsingtie keulwe pepeu hekei bamdi. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Penui pecu henui teicang dige, penui pe dade cwatie de radi eh penia pecu kai dai beudi, delwe pecu gwaktsetdi kerane pecu teu tetdi.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gwakkedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Penui tetpet lage, Cyreneme pei Simon de ngaulu, penui pe kemei tei eh pecu peu krus pwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Penui Golgotha pekie, “Mipeura Ni,” lie qu kela ni gega gwanglu. <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />Penui zau gage kekaa hai ncütlwe pecu sak kera peu. Dede pa msigai ge, pa cide sak raudi. <verse eid="MAT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Penui pecu gwakdi ge, penui dacak eh pe painidung mzilu, <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />pecai penui bamlu delwe cika pecu kwa bamdi. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Penui pe peu reu gage pecu kemmau sam, “Aide Jisu, Jewme Gwangpei,” de eh raugai. <verse eid="MAT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />Pecai kerega hangna pecu ngngwa gwaktset, hangge pe zetle bie nah hangge pe hile bie. <verse eid="MAT 27:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Pecu tetkah kegwangme penui peungum pecu kii eh, <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />rangdi, “Nang kerecaki teimsia delwe langcum ne gage cide tei dailu kerabe de, nkatei ncu kelilulo! Nang Tinggwang Nabe liecai, krus gade nghung lulo!” <verse eid="MAT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Cide nzwa cingku kedime nah laisiukecime nah hangkiamedung de si eh penui henui tei eh rangdi, <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />“Pa kedame de kelilula, dede pa pekatei pecu keli gilak. Pa au Israelme Gwangpei! Peu pecu cu krus gade nghung lulo, ciciu cai anui pecu nlum luzie. <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />Pa Tinggwang de nlumla, peu cu Tinggwang de pecu kelibeu lo, Tinggwang pesui lie cai. Kedanemene pa rangla, ‘Ih au Tinggwang Na.’” <verse eid="MAT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Cinzwa eh pecu ngngwa gwak pwa kebam keregabe kenade pecu keki sam rangdi.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu tsit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Cidau tingna tingding gade tinghegi bamcum kecang kideu reu pelane muitingdi. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Tinghegi bamcum tingdau ge, Jisu sahbak eh ranggai, “Eli, Eli, lama sabachthani?” pekie, “A Tinggwang, a Tinggwang, nang daitei acu gidi no?” <verse eid="MAT 27:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Cika kangge sap kebamme cide siu luge, penui rangdi, “Pa Elijah de qu zeu da.” <verse eid="MAT 27:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Ge zette penui hangge pau pakmie kenlünpai ge gage zau kehia mpunglu, herwatie ge gage kailu, delwe cide pecu sak kera pwapeu. <verse eid="MAT 27:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Kedame rangdi, “Pecu peu ciciu bamdi. Elijah gwang pecu kelilu ziemi lakbi kecu anui pie go.” <verse eid="MAT 27:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Pecai Jisu sahbak gai dai eh pe rabe kaibeudi. <verse eid="MAT 27:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Ainie, kerecaki kehezupai de pe tün gade pesing kecang hakmiedi, nah nnuiteu, nah tangtsudung pangpop di. <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />Heraudung ngkeidi, nah kemcime kekiee ge zip zeu kebamdung de cuhdi. <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />Jisu ringcuhdai kelucai, penui herau gade mpetdi, delwe kemci namdi ga lüt eh mina kekiee ge de peu ngaugai. <verse eid="MAT 27:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Cu haireukedibe nah pecu ngngwa Jisu de pie kebamme, nnuiteu kecu nah matei kedidung de ngau luge, penui ngngi sütti eh rangdi, “Aide Tinggwang Nabe kesang delie.” <verse eid="MAT 27:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Mipui kekiee ge Galilee gade Jisu caisui eh pecu ngha kelame, kemdei gega de pie bam. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Cipaume kakga Mary Magdalene, James nah Joseph pui Mary, nah Zebedee na kena pui bam.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu de kekung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Cipaunai tinghegi dige, Arimathea gade keheime ge gwang, pe zi Joseph nah pade Jisu caisuime ge. <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />Pa Pilate da gwang eh Jisu paau kiegai. Ge Pilate pe paau de pecu peu lulo aja kai beudi. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Ge Joseph pe paau de pwalu eh langcimpai kemci ge le hezuilu, <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />delwe tsurakang gage perau zielie keheci ge tei pwa kebam gage kaidi. Pecai pa tangtsu kedi gele herau kimuiki pwa kapdi delwe tetdi. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Mary Magdalene nah Mary kedabe pui de cika herau de mcwa eh ntum bam.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s">Herau ga kekwame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Pecai benai, cide Maketelei cai benai cingku kedimedung nah Phariseemedung Pilate de ngngwa ngkwa bam. <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />Penui rangdi, “Kedibo, mide cwa kelabe pa ring kebam dau, ‘Langcumne cai Ih ringcuh dai luzie,’ de kerang de anui nsung bam. <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Cine langcumne kecang herau de kwakwak kera samkai beulo, mecai ledeukelumedung gwang pe paau de regalwe minadung dage, ‘Pa ketsai gade ringcuh dida,’ de rang zie lu, nah kecwa kekambe au keraibe swade siaki dizie.” <verse eid="MAT 27:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Pilate penui dage rangdi, “Reketme de nzanglu. Mie delwe nnui kwakwaklu kebuita kwakwak lulo.” <verse eid="MAT 27:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Cine penui mie delwe tangtsu de giaklu eh reketme de peu herau de kwa bamdi.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s">Ringcuhkelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Sabbath cai benai, kemtak benai, Mary Magdalene nah Mary kedabe pui de herau de pie kera gwang. <verse eid="MAT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Ge ainie, nnuiteu sütdi, kedanemene Rampaube gwame tinggim gade nghung eh tangtsu de kela gidi, nah cika ntum bamdi. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Pe rehi tingkehepik nzwa, nah pe painidung ha pwa buising nzwadi. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Reketme pecu hing eh mbeudi nah ketsaime nzwadi. <verse eid="MAT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Dede tinggimgwabe mipui dage rangdi, “Ngngi so, kedanemene nnui gwaktset kedibe Jisu de peei kela Ih cibam. <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />Pa rang kegai nzwa pa au ringcuh dida nah pa aika bam meda.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat. 16:21; 20:19</char></note> Gwang delwe pa kezeuni de pielo. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />Kelwa mie pa ledeukelumedung de paubeulo, ‘Pa ketsai gade ringcuh dida. Ainie, pa au nnui dwa rai eh Galilee ga miela dida. Cikade nnui pecu ngaulu zie.’ Ainie, Ih nnuide ranglia dida.” <verse eid="MAT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Penui ngngi nah penui sui yi süt eh herau gade mzet tetdi, nah pa ledeukelumedung de paubeu kera pak miedi. <verse eid="MAT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Nah ainie, Jisu penaide redaulu eh ranggai, “Lungciep bam kelube tei lulo!” Penai gwang pe pi tuipwalu eh pecu recadi. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Pecai Jisu penui dage rangdi, “Ngngi so. Mie a siname de Galilee ga gwang lulo rang beulo. Cikade penui acu ngau luzie.”<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kekwame sam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Mipuidung mie kela dau, ainie, herau kekwame kangge namdi ga mie eh cingku kedime dage tei kedi pelane paubeu. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Penui hangkiamedung de redaulu delwe aipau ha de penuide ngngwa kempau luge, penui reugwamedung de rangkang kekiee ge peu, <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />delwe penuide rangbeu, “Minadung dage, ‘Tingmui anui zip kezeu dau ge pa ledeukelumedung gwang pe paau rega pwa dida,’ de lulo beu. <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Aipau sam de deuceudibe da gwangcang lucai, anui pe lung tei beuzie delwe nnuida peu keherei ga gwang dilak.” <verse eid="MAT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Cine reugwame rangkang keulu delwe penuide teilo kebeube teilu. Henai kecang de aipau sam de Jewme kakga rangrwa la.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Cu ledeukelumedung kereieket bau Galilee ga, Jisu penuide mie kera rang kebeu deutu ga miedi. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Penui pecu ngau luge, pecu recadi, dede kangge suihaudi. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Jisu gwang eh penui dage ranggai, “Tinggim nah kideu reu kengkieng pelane acu peu dida. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Ciziemne mie delwe heleuh leune de peu a caisuime tei lulo. Peibe, Nabe, nah kemci Rabe zi gade penuide duipum teibeu lu. <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />Nah Ih nnui dage rang kebeudung leune mzai lulo ledeu beu lulo. Ainie, Ih au nnuida lamui zie, tingkideu kegah benai kecang de.”<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>